<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JOS" style="id">- Biblica® Open New Luo Translation 2020</book>
  <para style="h">Joshua</para>
  <para style="toc1">Joshua</para>
  <para style="toc2">Joshua</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jos</para>
  <para style="mt1">Joshua</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JOS 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Jehova Nyasaye ogolo chik ne Joshua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 1:1"/>Kane Musa jatich Jehova Nyasaye osetho, Jehova Nyasaye nowachone Joshua wuod Nun, jakony Musa niya, <verse eid="JOS 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 1:2"/>Musa jatichna osetho. Omiyo sani, in kod jogi duto, ikreuru mondo ungʼad Aora Jordan e piny makoro achiegni miyo jo-Israel. <verse eid="JOS 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 1:3"/>Kamoro amora ma tiendu nonyon anamiu, kaka nasingora ni Musa. <verse eid="JOS 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 1:4"/>Gwengʼi nochakre e kuonde motwo nyaka Lebanon, kendo koa e aora maduongʼ, ma en Yufrate; piny mar jo-Hiti duto; nyaka chop e Nam Mediterania mantiere yo podho chiengʼ. <verse eid="JOS 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 1:5"/>Onge ngʼama noloyi e ndalo duto mar ngimani. Kaka ne an kod Musa, bende e kaka abiro bedo kodi; ok anaweyi kata jwangʼi.<verse eid="JOS 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 1:6"/>“Bed motegno kendo gi chir; nikech ibiro telone jogi nyaka e piny mar girkeni mane akwongʼora ni kweregi ni namigi. <verse eid="JOS 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 1:7"/>Bed motegno kendo gi chir mogundho. Bed motangʼ mondo iluor chike duto mane jatichna Musa omiyi; kik ilokri korachwich kata koracham kiweyo chikegi, mano nomi ibed gi hawi kamoro amora midhiye. <verse eid="JOS 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 1:8"/>Kik iwe Kitabu mar Chikni oa e dhogi; par wechene matut odiechiengʼ kod otieno, mondo mi ibed motangʼ kitimo gik moko duto mondik e iye. Mano biro miyo ibedo gi hawi e gimoro amora mitimo. <verse eid="JOS 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 1:9"/>Par kaka asechiki. Bed motegno kendo gi chir. Kik iluor kendo kik chunyi nyosre; nikech an Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachi abiro bedo kodi kamoro amora midhiye.”<verse eid="JOS 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 1:10"/>Omiyo Joshua nochiwo chik ni jotend Israel niya, <verse eid="JOS 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 1:11"/>“Dhiuru e kambi kendo unyis ji ni, ‘Ikuru gigeu mag lweny. Ndalo adek koa kawuono ubiro kalo aora Jordan gikae mondo udhi kendo ukaw mwandu mar piny ma Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu miyou kaka maru owuon.’ ”<verse eid="JOS 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 1:12"/>To joka Reuben, gi joka Gad kod nus mar dhood joka Manase, Joshua nowachonegi niya, <verse eid="JOS 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 1:13"/>“Paruru chike mane Musa jatich mar Jehova Nyasaye nomiyou, kowacho ni: ‘Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu miyou kar yweyo kendo osechiwonu pinyni.’ <verse eid="JOS 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 1:14"/>Mondeu, nyithindu kod kweth mag jambu nyalo dak e piny mane Musa omiyou yo ka wuok chiengʼ mar aora Jordan, makmana jou makedo duto, moikore gi gige lweny, nyaka uidh loka kutelo e nyim oweteu ma jo-Israel. Konyuru oweteu, <verse eid="JOS 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 1:15"/>nyaka Jehova Nyasaye migi yweyo, mana kaka osetimoni, kendo nyaka gin bende gikaw mwandu mar piny ma Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu dhi miyogi. Bangʼ mano, unyalo dok kendo udagie pinyu owuon, mane Musa, jatich Jehova Nyasaye nomiyou bath aora Jordan ma yo wuok chiengʼ.”<verse eid="JOS 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 1:16"/>Eka negidwoko Joshua niya, “Gimoro amora misechikowa wabiro timo, kendo kamoro amora mi iorowae wabiro dhiyoe. <verse eid="JOS 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 1:17"/>Mana kaka ne waluoro Musa, bende e kaka wabiro luoroi. Mad Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu bed kodi kaka nobedo gi Musa. <verse eid="JOS 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 1:18"/>Ngʼato angʼata modagi winjo wachni kendo ok oluoro wecheni bende ok odewo chike mimiyogi, ibiro negi. Bed mana motegno kendo jachir!”<verse eid="JOS 1:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JOS 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Rahab kod joma oor mondo odhi onon piny</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 2:1"/>Bangʼe Joshua wuod Nun nooro jonon piny ariyo lingʼ-lingʼ moa Shitim. Nowachonegi niya, “Dhiuru, ungʼi pinyni, to moloyo Jeriko.” Omiyo negidhi ma gidonjo e od dhako moro mandhaga ma nyinge Rahab, mi gidak kanyo.<verse eid="JOS 2:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 2:2"/>Ruodh Jeriko nonyisi niya, “Ngʼe ni jo-Israel moko osebiro ka gotienoni mondo onon pinywa.” <verse eid="JOS 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 2:3"/>Omiyo ruodh Jeriko nooro wach ni Rahab niya, “Gol oko jogo mane obiro iri kendo odonjo e odi, nikech gisebiro mondo gitim nonro ma lingʼ-lingʼ e pinyni duto.”<verse eid="JOS 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 2:4"/>Kata kamano, Rahab nosekawo ji ariyogi kendo opandogi. Nowacho niya, “En adier, ni jogi nobiro ira, to ne ok angʼeyo ni gia kanye. <verse eid="JOS 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 2:5"/>E seche mag angʼich welo, e sa michiegoe dhoranga dala maduongʼ, jogi nowuok. Ok angʼeyo yo mane gidhiyoe. Ringuru bangʼ-gi piyo. Unyalo makogi.” <verse eid="JOS 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 2:6"/>To chutho, noyudo ka osepando jogi ewi tado e bwo othith mane opedhi ewi tado kanyo. <verse eid="JOS 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 2:7"/>Omiyo oganda mar ruodh pinyno nowuok piyo ka gilawogi e yo mochiko aora Jordan, kendo mana gisano ka jogo mane lawogi nosewuok oko, dhorangajno nolor.<verse eid="JOS 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 2:8"/>Kane jonon pinygo ne pok odhi nindo, dhakoni noidho modhi ewi tado, <verse eid="JOS 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 2:9"/>kendo mowachonegi niya, “Angʼeyo ni Jehova Nyasaye osemiyou pinyni kendo mano osemiyo luoro omako ngʼato ka ngʼato kuomwa, omiyo joma odak e pinyni kihondko osemako nikech un. <verse eid="JOS 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 2:10"/>Wasewinjo kaka Jehova Nyasaye nomiyo pi Nam Makwar oduono kane uwuok e piny Misri, kendo gima ne utimone Sihon kod Og, ruodhi ariyo mag jo-Amor modak yo wuok chiengʼ mar aora Jordan, mane uketho chuth. <verse eid="JOS 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 2:11"/>Kane wawinjo wachno, to kihondko nomakowa kendo chir duto mane ngʼato angʼata nigo norumo nikech un, kendo nikech Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu en Nyasaye manie polo malo kendo e piny mwalo.<verse eid="JOS 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 2:12"/>“Kuom mano, kwongʼrenauru gi Jehova Nyasaye ni ubiro ngʼwonone jooda, nikech an bende asetimonu ngʼwono. Singrenauru <verse eid="JOS 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 2:13"/>ni ubiro ngʼwonone wuonwa kod minwa, owetena kod nyiminena, kod jogegi duto, kendo ni ubiro resowa mondo kik watho.”<verse eid="JOS 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 2:14"/>Jogi nowachone adier niya, “Ngimau en ngimawa! Ka ok uwacho gino ma watimo, to wabiro bedo kodu gi ngʼwono kod ratiro e ndalo ma Jehova Nyasaye nomiwa pinyni.”<verse eid="JOS 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 2:15"/>Omiyo nolorogi piny gi tol ka giluwo dirisa, nikech ot mane odakie ne ochwogi e kor ohinga mar dala maduongʼ. <verse eid="JOS 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 2:16"/>E sa onogo nowachonegi niya, “Dhiuru e got mondo joma lawou kik yudu. Ponduru kuno kuom ndalo adek nyaka giduogi; eka udhi nyime giwuodhu.”<verse eid="JOS 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 2:17"/>Jogi nowachone niya, “Kwongʼ ma isemiyo wakwongʼore godo ok otweyowa, <verse eid="JOS 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 2:18"/>makmana, chiengʼ mwadonjo e pinyni, to nyaka itwe tol makwarni e dirisa kama ilorowanie, kendo nyaka ikel wuonu gi minu, oweteni gi joodi duto ei odi. <verse eid="JOS 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 2:19"/>Ka dipo ni ngʼato owuok e odi modhi e yore mag mier, rembe enobed e wiye owuon; ok enobed wachwa. To ne ngʼatno manobed kodi ei ot, rembe nobedi e wiwa ka dipo ni lwedo moro nomule. <verse eid="JOS 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 2:20"/>Makmana, ka dipo ni iwacho gino ma watimo, to inigonywa kuom kwongʼruok mane iketowa wakwongʼore godo.”<verse eid="JOS 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 2:21"/>Nowachonegi niya, “Wawinjore! Kendo mondo obed kaka uwachono.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 2:21">Omiyo ne ogologi mi gidhi. Bangʼe notweyo tol makwar e dirisa.<verse eid="JOS 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 2:22"/>Kane gisea, negidhi nyaka e gode mi gidak kuno kuom ndalo adek, manyaka joma ne lawogi otieko manyo kuonde duto ka giluwo yo mi gidwogo ma ok giyudogi. <verse eid="JOS 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 2:23"/>Eka jonon piny ariyogi nolor oa e gode. Negingʼado aora, mi gidhi ir Joshua wuod Nun, kendo giwachone gigo duto mane otimorenigi. <verse eid="JOS 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 2:24"/>Negiwachone Joshua niya, “Adiera, Jehova Nyasaye osechiwo pinyni duto e lwetwa, bende jogo modak e pinyno kihondko osemako nikech wan.”<verse eid="JOS 2:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JOS 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Jo-Israel ongʼado Aora Jordan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 3:1"/>Gokinyi mangʼich Joshua kod jo-Israel duto nowuok koa Shitim, mi gidhi nyaka e aora Jordan, negibiro kanyo kapok giidho loka. <verse eid="JOS 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 3:2"/>Bangʼ ndalo adek jotelo nowuotho e kuonde kambi duto, <verse eid="JOS 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 3:3"/>ka gimiyogi chike niya, “Ka uneno ka Sandug Muma mar singruok mar Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu, otingʼ gi jodolo, ma jo-Lawi, to nyaka uwuog oko e kuonde muchungʼie mondo uluwe. <verse eid="JOS 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 3:4"/>Bangʼe ubiro ngʼeyo yo mudhiyoe, nikech ne pok uluwo yorni nyaka nene. Makmana, beduru mochwalore gi sandugno, madirom fut alufu ariyo mia ochiko gi piero abich gadek; kendo kik usud machiegni kode.”<verse eid="JOS 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 3:5"/>Joshua nokone oganda Israel niya, “Pwodhreuru, nikech kiny Jehova Nyasaye biro timo gigo miwuoro e kindu.”<verse eid="JOS 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 3:6"/>Joshua nowachone jodolo niya, “Kawuru Sandug Muma mar singruok kendo utel kode e nyim ji.” Omiyo ne gikawe mi gidhi nyimgi.<verse eid="JOS 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 3:7"/>Kendo Jehova Nyasaye nowachone Joshua niya, “Kawuono abiro tingʼi malo e wangʼ jo-Israel duto, eka ginyalo ngʼeyo ni An kodi mana kaka ne an gi Musa. <verse eid="JOS 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 3:8"/>Nyis jodolo matingʼo Sandug Muma mar singruok ni, ‘Ka uchopo e geng pige mag aora Jordan, to dhiuru kendo uchungʼ ei aora.’ ”<verse eid="JOS 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 3:9"/>Joshua nowachone jo-Israel niya, “Biuru kae kendo uchik itu ne weche Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu. <verse eid="JOS 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 3:10"/>Kawuononi ubiro neno ranyisi ni Nyasaye mangima nikodu kendo enoriemb e nyimu jo-Kanaan, jo-Hiti, jo-Hivi, jo-Perizi, jo-Girgash, jo-Amor kod jo-Jebus. <verse eid="JOS 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 3:11"/>Ne, Sandug Muma mar singruok mar Jehova Nyasaye Manyalo Gik Moko Duto biro dhi nyimu nyaka aora Jordan. <verse eid="JOS 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 3:12"/>Koro omiyo, yier ji apar gariyo koa e dhout Israel, ngʼato achiel koa e dhoot ka dhoot. <verse eid="JOS 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 3:13"/>E sa ma jodolo motingʼo Sandug Muma mar singruok mar Jehova Nyasaye ma en Ruoth Nyasaye mar piny duto, nonyon aora Jordan, pige-ge mamol koluwo aora tir nochungʼ kogingore ka pith.”<verse eid="JOS 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 3:14"/>Omiyo ka ji noke oa e kambi mag-gi mondo gingʼad aora Jordan, jodolo motingʼo Sandug Muma mar singruok notelo nyimgi. <verse eid="JOS 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 3:15"/>Aora Jordan koro notimo ataro kuonde duto nyaka ndalo mag keyo. Omiyo ka jodolo mane otingʼo Sandug Muma mar singruok nochopo e aora Jordan mi tiendegi omulo geng aora, <verse eid="JOS 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 3:16"/>pige mane mol koa malo nochungʼ. Nogingore malo kaka pith, e dala miluongo ni Adam man but Zarethan. Pi mane mol kadhi e nam mar Araba (ma tiende ni Nam Chumbi) nochungʼ chuth, omiyo ji nongʼado modhi loka komachielo, momanyore gi Jeriko. <verse eid="JOS 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 3:17"/>Jodolo mane otingʼo Sandug Muma mar singruok mar Jehova Nyasaye nochungʼ motegno e lowo motwo e dier aora Jordan, nyaka ogendini mag jo-Israel notieko kadho ka giwuotho e lowo motwo.<verse eid="JOS 3:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JOS 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 4:1"/>Kane ogendini duto otieko ngʼado aora Jordan, Jehova Nyasaye nowachone Joshua niya, <verse eid="JOS 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 4:2"/>“Yier ji apar gariyo e kind jogi, ngʼato achiel koa e dhoot ka dhoot, <verse eid="JOS 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 4:3"/>kendo ikonegi mondo gikaw kite apar gariyo e dier aora Jordan yo korachwich koma jodolo ochungoe kendo gitingʼ-gi mi giketgi piny kama gidhi dakie otieno ma kawuono.”<verse eid="JOS 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 4:4"/>Omiyo Joshua noluongo ji apar gariyo mane oseyiero koa kuom jo-Israel, ngʼato achiel koa e dhoot ka dhoot, <verse eid="JOS 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 4:5"/>kendo nowachonegi niya, “Dhiuru e nyim Sandug Muma mar Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu nyaka uchop e dier aora Jordan. Ngʼato ka ngʼato nyaka kaw kidi e goke, kaluwore gi kwan mar dhout Israel, <verse eid="JOS 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 4:6"/>mondo obed kaka ranyisi e dieru. E ndalo mabiro, ka nyithindu openjou ni, ‘Kitegi nyiso angʼo?’ <verse eid="JOS 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 4:7"/>To nyisgiuru kaka pi aora Jordan noduono kane Sandug Muma mar singruok mar Jehova Nyasaye kadho. Kane ongʼad kode aora Jordan, to pige mag aora Jordan noduono. Kitegi mondo obed rapar ni jo-Israel nyaka chiengʼ.”<verse eid="JOS 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 4:8"/>Omiyo jo-Israel notimo kaka Joshua nochikogi. Negikawo kite apar gariyo koa e dier aora Jordan, kaluwore gi kwan mar dhout Israel, kaka Jehova Nyasaye nokone Joshua; kendo negitingʼogi nyaka kama negibuoroe, kanyo negiketogie piny. <verse eid="JOS 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 4:9"/>Joshua nochano kite apar gariyogo mane ni e dier aora Jordan kama jodolo mane otingʼo Sandug Muma mar singruok nosechungʼe kendo kitego pod ni kanyo nyaka chil kawuono.<verse eid="JOS 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 4:10"/>Koro jodolo mane otingʼo Sandug Muma mar singruok nodongʼ kochungʼ e dier aora Jordan nyaka ji notieko timo gik moko duto mane Jehova Nyasaye ochiko Joshua, mana kaka Musa nochiko Joshua. Ji nokadho mapiyo nono kadhi, <verse eid="JOS 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 4:11"/>kendo bangʼ kane gisekadho giduto, eka jodolo bende nokadho modhi loka komachielo kotingʼo Sandug Muma mar Jehova Nyasaye ka ji duto neno. <verse eid="JOS 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 4:12"/>Jo-Reuben, jo-Gad kod nus mar dhood Manase nongʼado ka gimanore gi gige lweny e nyim jo-Israel, mana kaka Musa nosechikogi. <verse eid="JOS 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 4:13"/>Ji madirom alufu piero angʼwen mane moikore ni lweny mondo gikedi, nongʼado loka kocha e nyim Jehova Nyasaye nyaka e pewe mag Jeriko.<verse eid="JOS 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 4:14"/>E odiechiengʼno, Jehova Nyasaye notingʼo Joshua malo e nyim jo-Israel, mi gimiye luor ndalo duto mag ngimane, mana kaka negimiyo Musa luor.<verse eid="JOS 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 4:15"/>Bangʼe Jehova Nyasaye nowachone Joshua niya, <verse eid="JOS 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 4:16"/>“Chik jodolo motingʼo Sandug Muma mondo giwuog oko mar aora Jordan.”<verse eid="JOS 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 4:17"/>Omiyo Joshua nochiwo chik ni jodolo niya, “Wuoguru oko mar aora Jordan.”<verse eid="JOS 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 4:18"/>Kendo jodolo nowuok oko e aora kotingʼo Sandug Muma mar singruok mar Jehova Nyasaye. Kadiemo wangʼ kapok giketo tiendegi e lowo motwo, to pige mag aora Jordan noduogo e wangʼe mi ochako mol mogingore kaka chon.<verse eid="JOS 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 4:19"/>E odiechiengʼ mar apar gariyo mar dwe mokwongo, ji noa e aora Jordan mi ochokore Gilgal e tongʼ ma yo podho chiengʼ mar Jeriko. <verse eid="JOS 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 4:20"/>Kendo Joshua nochungo kite apar gariyogo Gilgal, ma gin kite mane ogolo e aora Jordan. <verse eid="JOS 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 4:21"/>Nowachone jo-Israel niya, “E ndalo mabiro ka nyikwau nopenj wuoneu ni, ‘Kitegi nyiso angʼo?’ <verse eid="JOS 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 4:22"/>To nyisgiuru ni, ‘Jo-Israel nongʼado aora Jordan kawuotho e lowo motwo.’ <verse eid="JOS 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 4:23"/>Nimar Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu notwoyo aora Jordan e nyimu nyaka ukalo loka kocha. Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu notimo ni aora Jordan mana gima notimone Nam Makwar e ndalo mane otwoye e nyimu nyaka ne ungʼado loka kocha. <verse eid="JOS 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 4:24"/>Notimo kamano mondo ji duto manie piny ongʼe ni lwet Jehova Nyasaye nigi teko kendo mondo omi uluor Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu kinde duto.”<verse eid="JOS 4:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JOS 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Oter jo-Israel nyangu Gilgal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 5:1"/>Kane ruodhi duto ma jo-Amor modak yo podho chiengʼ mar aora Jordan to gi ruodhi duto mag jo-Kanaan modak e dho nam nowinjo kaka Jehova Nyasaye notwoyo aora Jordan e nyim jo-Israel nyaka negingʼado, chunygi nobwok kendo ne gionge gi chir mar chomo jo-Israel tir.<verse eid="JOS 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 5:2"/>E sechego Jehova Nyasaye nowachone Joshua niya, “Piag pelni mabith mondo ichak terogo jo-Israel nyangu.” <verse eid="JOS 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 5:3"/>Omiyo Joshua nopiago pelni mabith mi otero jo-Israel nyangu kama iluongo ni Gibeath Haraloth.<verse eid="JOS 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 5:4"/>Gima omiyo notimo kamano en nikech ji duto mane oa Misri; ma gin jogo mahikgi noromo kedo e lweny, notho e thim ka gisewuok gia Misri. <verse eid="JOS 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 5:5"/>Jogo duto mane oa Misri noseter nyangu, makmana joma nonywol e thim ka gisea Misri ema ne pod ok oter nyangu. <verse eid="JOS 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 5:6"/>Jo-Israel nosewuotho e thim kuom thuolo maromo higni piero angʼwen manyaka ji duto mahikgi oromo kedo e lweny mane giwuokgo Misri nosetho nikech ne ok giseluoro Jehova Nyasaye. Jehova Nyasaye nosekwongʼorenegi ni ok gininee piny mane osingo ne kweregi mondo omigi, piny mopongʼ gi chak kod mor kich. <verse eid="JOS 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 5:7"/>Omiyo yawuotgi mane onywol bangʼe ka gin e thim ema ne Joshua otero nyangu. Ne pod ok otergi nyangu nikech ne oyudo kapod giwuotho e thim. <verse eid="JOS 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 5:8"/>Bangʼ kane ogandani duto oseter nyangu, ne gidongʼ e kambi nyaka ne gichango.<verse eid="JOS 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 5:9"/>Bangʼ mano, Jehova Nyasaye nowachone Joshua niya, “Kawuono asetieko ajara mar jo-Misri kuomu.” Omiyo kanyo iluongo ni Gilgal nyaka chil kawuono.<verse eid="JOS 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 5:10"/>Godhiambo mar odiechiengʼ mar apar angʼwen mar dweno, jo-Israel nochokore Gilgal e pewe mag Jeriko kendo negitimo nyasi mar Pasaka. <verse eid="JOS 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 5:11"/>Kinyne bangʼ Pasaka, mana godiechiengno, negichamo bath nyak mar piny kaka, makati ma ok oketie thowi gi chamb abula. <verse eid="JOS 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 5:12"/>Bangʼ odiechiengʼ achiel kane gisechamo chiemo moa e pinyno, chiemb manna ne ok ochako biro ni jo-Israel nikech e higano negichamo mana nyak mar Kanaan.<verse eid="JOS 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jeriko opodho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 5:13"/>Ka koro Joshua ne chiegni chopo Jeriko, nongʼiyo nyime mi oneno ngʼato mochungʼ kotingʼo ligangla e lwete. Joshua nosudo machiegni kode mopenje niya, “In jakorwa koso jasikwa?”<verse eid="JOS 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 5:14"/>Ngʼatno nodwoke niya, “Ok an maru kata mar wasiku, to asebiro kaka jatend lweny mar Jehova Nyasaye.” Omiyo Joshua nopodho auma e nyime gi luor, mi openje niya, “En wach mane ma ruodha nigodo ni jatichne?”<verse eid="JOS 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 5:15"/>Jatend lweny mar Jehova Nyasaye nodwoko niya, “Gol wuoche manie tiendi, nikech kama ichungoeni en Kama Ler.” Omiyo Joshua notimo kamano.<verse eid="JOS 5:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JOS 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 6:1"/>Koro Jeriko nolor motegno nikech jo-Israel kendo onge ngʼama ne nyalo wuok oko kata donjo iye.<verse eid="JOS 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 6:2"/>Bangʼe Jehova Nyasaye nowacho ni Joshua niya, “Ne, asechiwo Jeriko gi ruodhe e lweti, kaachiel gi jolweny mage. <verse eid="JOS 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 6:3"/>Lworuru dala maduongʼno dichiel ka un gi giu mag lweny kendo timuru ma kuom ndalo auchiel. <verse eid="JOS 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 6:4"/>Beduru gi jodolo abiriyo motingʼo turumbete molos gi tunge imbe e nyim Sandug Muma. E odiechiengʼ mar abiriyo, lworuru dala maduongʼno nyadibiriyo, ka jodolo goyo turumbetego. <verse eid="JOS 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 6:5"/>Ka uwinjogi ka gigoyo turumbetegi matek, to ket ji duto ogo koko matek; bangʼe ohinga mar Jeriko nopodh piny kendo ji duto nodonj e iye.”<verse eid="JOS 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 6:6"/>Omiyo Joshua wuod Nun noluongo jodolo mowachonegi niya, “Tingʼuru Sandug Muma mar singruok mar Jehova Nyasaye kendo beduru gi jodolo abiriyo kotingʼo turumbete e nyime.” <verse eid="JOS 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 6:7"/>Eka nochiwo chik ne ji niya, “Dhiuru nyime! Lworuru dala maduongʼ, ka jolweny momanore gi gige lweny otelo e nyim Sandug Muma mar singruok mar Jehova Nyasaye.”<verse eid="JOS 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 6:8"/>Kane Joshua osewuoyo gi ji, jodolo abiriyo mane otingʼo turumbete abiriyo e nyim Jehova Nyasaye nowuotho ka gigoyo turumbete, kendo Sandug Muma mar Singruok mar Jehova Nyasaye ne luwo bangʼ-gi. <verse eid="JOS 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 6:9"/>Jolwenygo notelo e nyim jodolo mane goyo turumbete, to moko ne luwo bangʼ Sandug Muma, kendo e kindeno duto turumbete ne ywak. <verse eid="JOS 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 6:10"/>Makmana Joshua nosiemo ji niya, “Kik uywag ywak mar lweny, kik utingʼ dwondu malo, bende kik uwach wach moro amora nyaka odiechiengʼ ma anakonue mondo ugo koko. Bangʼe eka unukogi!” <verse eid="JOS 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 6:11"/>Omiyo negikawo Sandug Muma mar Jehova Nyasaye ka gilworogo dala maduongʼno dichiel. Bangʼe ji noduogo e kambi margi mi otienono ginindo kanyo.<verse eid="JOS 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 6:12"/>Joshua nochiewo gokinyi mangʼich kinyne kendo jodolo nokawo Sandug Muma mar Jehova Nyasaye. <verse eid="JOS 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 6:13"/>Jodolo abiriyo mane otingʼo turumbete abiriyo nodhi nyime, ka gipangore e nyim Sandug Muma mar Jehova Nyasaye kendo ka gigoyo turumbete. Ji momanore gi gige lweny notelo e nyimgi, to moko ne luwo bangʼ Sandug Muma mar Jehova Nyasaye ka turumbete dhi nyime gi ywak. <verse eid="JOS 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 6:14"/>E odiechiengʼ mar ariyo negilworo dala maduongʼno dichiel bangʼe gidok e kambi kendo negitimo kamano kuom ndalo auchiel.<verse eid="JOS 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 6:15"/>To chiengʼ mar abiriyo, ne gichiewo kogwen mi gilworo dala maduongʼno nyadibiriyo e yo machalre gi mamoko ka. Chiengʼno kende ema negilworo dala maduongʼno nyadibiriyo. <verse eid="JOS 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 6:16"/>E sa mane gilwore mar abiriyo ka jodolo ne pod goyo turumbete matek, Joshua nochiko ji kawacho niya, “Koguru matek, nimar Jehova Nyasaye osemiyou dala maduongʼni! <verse eid="JOS 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 6:17"/>Dala maduongʼni duto, to gi gik moko duto manie iye nyaka wene Jehova Nyasaye. Makmana Rahab, mochot, to gi jogo duto manie ode ema nongʼwon-ne, nikech nopando joma ne waoro mane obiro nono piny. <verse eid="JOS 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 6:18"/>To beduru mabor gi gigo mowene Jehova Nyasaye, mondo kik ukel kethruok ne un uwuon kuom gimoro amora kuomgi. Ka ok kamano to unumi kambi mar jo-Israel bed mar kethruok kendo ukel chandruok kuome. <verse eid="JOS 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 6:19"/>Fedha gi dhahabu duto, kod gigo molos gi mula kod molos gi nyinyo owal ni Jehova Nyasaye kendo nyaka tergi kar keno mare.”<verse eid="JOS 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 6:20"/>Kane ogo turumbete, to ji ne goyo koko matek, kendo ka turumbete noywak, mi ji nogoyo koko matek, to ohinga mar Jeriko nopodho, omiyo ngʼato ka ngʼato nodonjo e dala maduongʼno mi gikawe. <verse eid="JOS 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 6:21"/>Negiwalo dala maduongʼno ni Jehova Nyasaye ma giketho gimoro amora kendo ginego gi ligangla ngʼato angʼata madichwo kata madhako, jomatindo kata joma oti, dhok gi rombe kod punde.<verse eid="JOS 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 6:22"/>Joshua nowachone jonon piny ariyogo niya, “Dhiuru e od Rahab kendo ukele kaachiel gi joodgi duto, kaluwore gi singruok mane uketo kode.” <verse eid="JOS 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 6:23"/>Omiyo rawere mane odhi nono pinyno nodhi Jeriko e od Rahab mi ogole kaachiel gi wuon-gi, min-gi, owetene kod joodgi duto. Negigolo anywolane duto oko mi giketogi oko mar kambi jo-Israel.<verse eid="JOS 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 6:24"/>Bangʼe ne giwangʼo dala maduongʼno duto, to gi gimoro amora manie iye, makmana fedha gi dhahabu, gi gik molos gi mula kod molos gi nyinyo noketi e kar keno mar od Jehova Nyasaye. <verse eid="JOS 6:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 6:25"/>Kamano Joshua noreso Rahab, dhako ma ochot, kaachiel gi anywolane nikech en ema nopando jonon piny mane Joshua ooro Jeriko kendo Rahab nodak e dier jo-Israel nyaka chil kawuono.<verse eid="JOS 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 6:26"/>E sechego Joshua nolando kwongʼ makende niya, “Kwongʼ mar Jehova Nyasaye nobed kuom ngʼat manitem gero dala maduongʼ mar Jeriko kendo kama:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOS 6:26">“Koketo mise mare,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOS 6:26">to wuode makayo notho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOS 6:26">to kochungo dhorangeyege;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOS 6:26">to wuode mogik notho.”<verse eid="JOS 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 6:27"/>Omiyo Jehova Nyasaye ne nigi Joshua kendo humbe nolandore e pinyno duto.<verse eid="JOS 6:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JOS 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Richo mar Akan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 7:1"/>Jo-Israel ne ok obedo jo-ratiro kaluwore gi gik mane owal ni Jehova Nyasaye. Ngʼat mane nyinge Akan wuod Karmi, ma wuod Zabdi, ma wuod Zera, mar dhood Juda nokawo moko kuom gik mane owalgi. Omiyo Jehova Nyasaye nobedo gi mirima gi jo-Israel.<verse eid="JOS 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 7:2"/>Kane Joshua ooro ji koa Jeriko mondo odhi Ai, mantiere but Beth Aven yo podho chiengʼ mar Bethel nokonegi niya, “Dhiuru kendo utim nonro ma lingʼ-lingʼ mar gwengʼno.” Omiyo jogo nodhi mi ginono Ai lingʼ-lingʼ.<verse eid="JOS 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 7:3"/>Kane gidwogo ir Joshua, negiwachone niya, “Ji duto ok onego dhi kedo gi jo-Ai. To or ji alufu ariyo kata adek mondo odhi okawe kendo kik oket ji obed mool nikech nitiere mana ji manok kuno.” <verse eid="JOS 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 7:4"/>Omiyo ji madirom alufu adek ema nodhi, to jo-Ai noriembogi, <verse eid="JOS 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 7:5"/>mi ji madirom piero adek gauchiel nonegi. Ne giriembo jo-Israel koa e dhoranga dala maduongʼ nyaka kama nitiere kite mopa kendo neginegogi e holo. Mano nomiyo kihondko nogoyogi ma gipodho.<verse eid="JOS 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 7:6"/>Bangʼe Joshua noyiecho lepe mi opodho auma e nyim Sandug Muma mar Jehova Nyasaye, moriyo kanyo nyaka odhiambo. Jodong Israel bende notimo kamano kendo ne giolo buru e wigi. <verse eid="JOS 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 7:7"/>Joshua nowacho niya, “Yaye, Jehova Nyasaye Manyalo Gik Moko Duto, ere gima omiyo isekelo jogi loka mar aora Jordan mana ni mondo ichiwgi e lwet jo-Amor mondo itiekgi? Mad ne gik mane wan-go loka cha romwa kendo wasik kuno! <verse eid="JOS 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 7:8"/>Yaye, Ruoth Nyasaye, en angʼo ma dwawachi ka jo-Israel oseriemb gi wasikgi kama? <verse eid="JOS 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 7:9"/>Jo-Kanaan gi jopinyni mamoko biro winjo kuom wachni kendo gibiro monjowa mi gitiekwa e pinyni. Angʼo ma nitim mondo ires nyingi maduongʼni?”<verse eid="JOS 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 7:10"/>Jehova Nyasaye nowacho ni Joshua niya, “Chungʼ malo! Angʼo ma ikulone wiyi piny ka? <verse eid="JOS 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 7:11"/>Jo-Israel osetimo richo, kendo giseketho singruokna mane achikogi mondo giriti. Gisekawo bath gik moko mane owal, gisekwalo, giseriambo, kendo gisekawo gigo mokwer ma giriwo gi gig-gi giwegi. <verse eid="JOS 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 7:12"/>Mano emomiyo jo-Israel ok nyal loyo wasikgi; giloko ngʼegi kendo giringo nikech oseketgi gir kethruok. Ok anabed kodu makmana ka uketho gigo manie dieru mowal ni kethruok.<verse eid="JOS 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 7:13"/>“Aa malo mondo inyis jo-Israel opwodhre kinyisogi ni, ‘Pwodhreuru kuikoru ni odiechiengʼ ma kiny nikech Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasach Israel wacho kama: Gik mowal ne Jehova Nyasaye nitie e dieru, yaye Israel, omiyo kapod ok ugolo gigo kuomu, to ok unulo wasiku.<verse eid="JOS 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 7:14"/>“ ‘Wuoguru gokinyi dhoot ka dhoot. Dhoot ma Jehova Nyasaye noyier biro biro e nyime anywola ka anywola, to anywola ma Jehova Nyasaye noyier biro biro e nyime dala ka dala, kendo dala ma Jehova Nyasaye noyier biro biro e nyime ngʼato ka ngʼato. <verse eid="JOS 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 7:15"/>Ngʼatno mani maki gi gigo mowal notieki gi mach, kaachiel gi gige duto, nikech oseketho singruok mar Jehova Nyasaye kendo osetimo gima mono e piny Israel!’ ”<verse eid="JOS 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 7:16"/>Kinyne gokinyi mangʼich Joshua noluongo jo-Israel gi dhoutgi, kendo Juda noyier. <verse eid="JOS 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 7:17"/>Anywola mar Juda nobiro, mi oyier joka Zera. Joka Zera nobiro ot ka ot mi od Zabdi ema noyier. <verse eid="JOS 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 7:18"/>Kane ogolo ngʼato ka ngʼato kuom joka Zabdi, to Akan wuod Karmi, ma wuod Zimri, ma wuod Zera mar dhood Juda ema noyier.<verse eid="JOS 7:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 7:19"/>Bangʼ mano, Joshua nowachone Akan niya, “Wuoda, mi Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasach Israel duongʼ gi pak. Nyisa gima isetimo kendo kik ipanda.”<verse eid="JOS 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 7:20"/>Akan nodwoke niya, “En adier! Asetimone Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasach Israel richo. Ma e gima asetimo: <verse eid="JOS 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 7:21"/>Kane aneno gik miketho kaka njora maber moa Babulon, gi fedha ma pekne dirom kilo ariyo, to gi dhahabu ma pekne oromo nus kilo, to chunya nogombogi mi akawogi kendo apandogi e bwo lowo ei hemba ka fedha ema oket piny mogik.”<verse eid="JOS 7:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 7:22"/>Omiyo Joshua nooro joote mi giringo e hema kendo ne giyudogi mana kaka gin, kopandgi e hembe, ka fedha ema oket piny mogik. <verse eid="JOS 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 7:23"/>Negigolo gigo koa e hema, mi gikelogi ni Joshua kod jo-Israel duto kendo gipedhogi oko e nyim Jehova Nyasaye.<verse eid="JOS 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 7:24"/>Bangʼ mano Joshua, kaachiel gi jo-Israel duto nokawo Akan ma nyakwar Zera, gi fedha, gi njora, gi dhahabu, yawuote kod nyige, dhok, punde kod rombe, hembe kod gigo duto ma en godo mi giterogi nyaka e holo mar Akor. <verse eid="JOS 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 7:25"/>Joshua nowacho niya, “Angʼo momiyo isekelo masira machal kama kuomwa? In bende Jehova Nyasaye biro keloni masira.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 7:25">Bangʼe jo-Israel duto nochielo Akan kod joge gi kite, kendo ne giwangʼe kaachiel gi joge. <verse eid="JOS 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 7:26"/>Bangʼ mano ne gidhuro kite kuom Akan, ma mano pod ni kamano nyaka chil kawuono. Eka mirima mar Jehova Nyasaye norumo. Kuom mano kanyo pod iluongo ni Holo mar Akor nyaka chil kawuono.<verse eid="JOS 7:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JOS 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Ai okethi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 8:1"/>Eka Jehova Nyasaye nowachone Joshua niya, “Kik iluor, kendo kik chunyi nyosre. Kaw jolweny duto mondo udhi umonj Ai, nimar asechiwo e lwetu ruodh Ai, joge, dalane maduongʼ kod pinye. <verse eid="JOS 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 8:2"/>Timneuru Ai kod ruodhe mana kaka ne utimone Jeriko kod ruodhe, to wangʼni oyienu kawo gigo mane giyudo e yor mecho kaachiel gi jamni. Monjuru dala maduongʼno gi yo katoke.”<verse eid="JOS 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 8:3"/>Omiyo Joshua kod jolweny duto nowuok mondo gimonj Ai. Noyiero joge alufu piero adek molony e lweny mi oorogi oko gotieno komiyogi chik niya, <verse eid="JOS 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 8:4"/>“Winjuru. Nyaka umonj dala maduongʼno gi yo katoke. Kik udhi mabor ahinya. Un duto nyaka uikru. <verse eid="JOS 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 8:5"/>An kod jogo duto man koda, to biro dhi nyime e dala maduongʼ, to ka jogo obiro mondo omonjwa kaka negitimo motelocha, to wabiro ringo waa irgi. <verse eid="JOS 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 8:6"/>Gibiro luwo bangʼwa nyaka wawuondgi mi giwuog oko mar dala maduongʼ, mi giniwach e chunygi ni, ‘Ne, giringowa mana kaka ne giringowa motelo.’ Omiyo seche mwaringogino <verse eid="JOS 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 8:7"/>nyaka uwuog kuma upondoe kendo ukaw dala maduongʼno. Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu biro ketogi e lwetu. <verse eid="JOS 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 8:8"/>Ka usekawo dala maduongʼno, to uwangʼe gi mach. Timuru gima Jehova Nyasaye osechiko kendo nyaka une ni utimo gik ma achikou.”<verse eid="JOS 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 8:9"/>Eka Joshua noorogi ma gidhi gipondo e kind Bethel gi Ai, ma en yo podho chiengʼ mar Ai, kendo otienono nosiko gi ji kanyo.<verse eid="JOS 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 8:10"/>Kinyne gokinyi mangʼich Joshua nochoko jolweny mage duto ka en kaachiel gi jodong Israel wuotho e nyimgi kadhi Ai. <verse eid="JOS 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 8:11"/>Jolweny duto mane ni kode ne wuotho ka gichomo dala maduongʼ nyaka negichopo machiegni kode. Negigero kambigi yo nyandwat mar Ai, ka holo ni e kindgi kod dala maduongʼ. <verse eid="JOS 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 8:12"/>Joshua nokawo ji madirom alufu abich mooro yo podho chiengʼ mar Ai mondo opond e kind Bethel kod dala maduongʼno. <verse eid="JOS 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 8:13"/>Kuom mano thoth jolweny nobworo yo nyandwat mar dala maduongʼno, to joma nopondo ne ni yo podho chiengʼ. Otienono Joshua to nonindo e holo.<verse eid="JOS 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 8:14"/>Kane ruodh Ai oneno ma, en kod ji duto mar dala maduongʼ nowuok oko mapiyo nono gokinyi mangʼich mondo girom kod jo-Israel e lweny kama omanyore gi Araba. To ne ok ongʼeyo ni kar pondo noseketi e ngʼe dala maduongʼno. <verse eid="JOS 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 8:15"/>Joshua kod jo-Israel duto nowuondore ni ologi, mi giringo ka gichiko thim. <verse eid="JOS 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 8:16"/>Chwo duto ma Ai nowuok mondo olaw Joshua gi joge, to kane gilawogi kamano, to ne gichwalore mabor gi dala maduongʼno. <verse eid="JOS 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 8:17"/>Onge ngʼama nodongʼ Ai kata Bethel mane ok olawo jo-Israel. Ne giweyo dala maduongʼ nono ka gilawo jo-Israel.<verse eid="JOS 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 8:18"/>Eka Jehova Nyasaye nowachone Joshua niya, “Siem yo Ai gi tongʼ mitingʼo e lwetino, nikech e lweti abiro chiwoe dala maduongʼno.” Omiyo Joshua nosiemo tongʼe kochiko Ai. <verse eid="JOS 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 8:19"/>E seche mane otimo ma, jogo mane opondo noa malo piyo ka giringo gidonjo e dala maduongʼ. Bangʼ kane gisekawe, ne giwangʼe mana gisano.<verse eid="JOS 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 8:20"/>Jo-Ai nongʼiyo chien ma gineno ka iro dhwolore e dala maduongʼ kochiko polo, makmana ne gionge gi thuolo mar pondo e yo moro amora nikech jo-Israel mane osebedo kawuondore ni ringo kochiko thim nolokore kod jogo mane lawogi. <verse eid="JOS 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 8:21"/>Kane Joshua kod jo-Israel noneno ka joma nopondo osekawo dala maduongʼ kendo iro bende ne dhwolore kanyo, negilokore mi gimonjo jo-Ai. <verse eid="JOS 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 8:22"/>Jogo mane opondo bende nowuok oko mar dala maduongʼ moromo kodgi kendo omonjogi, omiyo nogengʼnegi e diere ka jo-Israel ni koni gi koni. Jo-Israel notiekogi pep maonge ngʼama notony kata achiel. <verse eid="JOS 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 8:23"/>Ruodh Ai kende ema negimako kangima kendo negitere ir Joshua.<verse eid="JOS 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 8:24"/>Kane jo-Israel ne osetieko nego jo-Ai duto mane ni e pap kod mane ni e thim kama ne giselawogie, kendo kane gisenegogi duto gi ligangla, jo-Israel nodok Ai mi ginego jogo mane odongʼ kuno. <verse eid="JOS 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 8:25"/>Jo-Ai duto machwo kod mamon alufu apar gariyo notho chiengʼno. <verse eid="JOS 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 8:26"/>Joshua ne ok owe siemo Ai gi tongʼ mane otingʼo e lwete nyaka Israel notieko ji duto mane odak Ai. <verse eid="JOS 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 8:27"/>Jo-Israel to nokawo jamni gi mwandu mane giyako mar dala maduongʼno mana kaka Jehova Nyasaye nosechiko Joshua.<verse eid="JOS 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 8:28"/>Omiyo Joshua nowangʼo Ai mi okete obedo pith mongingore mar kethruok kendo pod en kamano nyaka chil kawuono. <verse eid="JOS 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 8:29"/>Ne onego ruodh Ai mi oliere gi tol e yath kama noriyoe nyaka odhiambo. Kane ochopo odhiambo, Joshua nogolo chik mondo ogol ringre oko e yath kendo lware piny e dhoranga dala maduongʼ. Nodhur kuome kite mangʼeny ma pod ni kanyo nyaka chil kawuono.<verse eid="JOS 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Otim singruok mar Sandug Muma e Got Ebal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 8:30"/>Eka Joshua nogero kendo mar misango e got Ebal ni Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasach Israel, <verse eid="JOS 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 8:31"/>mana kaka Musa jatich Jehova Nyasaye nosechiko jo-Israel. Nogere kaluwore gi gima nondiki e kitap Chik mar Musa niya, Kendo mar misango moger gi kite ma ok opa, gi gir nyinyo. Ewi kendono ema negichiwone Jehova Nyasaye misango miwangʼo pep kod misango mar lalruok. <verse eid="JOS 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 8:32"/>Joshua nondiko chik Musa e kitego e nyim jo-Israel. <verse eid="JOS 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 8:33"/>Jo-Israel duto, jopinje mamoko kod jopinyno machalre, ka gin gi jodong-gi, gi jotendgi kod jongʼad bura nochungʼ e bath Sandug Muma mar singruok mar Jehova Nyasaye koni gi koni, ka gimanyore gi jo-Lawi ma gin jodolo. Nus mar jo-Israel nochungʼ kochomo got Gerizim, to nus mar jo-Israel mamoko nochungʼ kochomo got Ebal mana kaka Musa ma jatich Jehova Nyasaye nosechiko chon kane ochiwo nonro mar gwedho jo-Israel.<verse eid="JOS 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 8:34"/>Bangʼ mano, Joshua nosomo weche mag chik ma gin, gweth gi kwongʼ mana kaka ondikgi e Kitap Chik mar Musa. <verse eid="JOS 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 8:35"/>Onge chik Musa mane Joshua oweyo ma ok osomo ni kanyakla mar Israel duto, kaachiel gi mon, gi nyithindo, kod jopinje mamoko mane odak e diergi.<verse eid="JOS 8:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JOS 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Jo-Gibeon owuondo jo-Israel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 9:1"/>Ruodhi duto mane odak yo podho chiengʼ mar aora Jordan nowinjo humb wechego; mane gin ruodhi moa e tiend gode mag pinyno, gi ruodhi moa yo podho chiengʼ mar gode gi mago moa e wedhe mag Nam Mediterania kaachiel gi ruodhi moa Lebanon (mane gin ruodhi mag jo-Hiti, jo-Amor, jo-Kanaan, jo-Perizi, jo-Hivi kod mago mag jo-Jebus); <verse eid="JOS 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 9:2"/>ruodhigo noriwore giduto mondo giked gi Joshua kod jo-Israel.<verse eid="JOS 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 9:3"/>Kata kamano, kane jo-Gibeon owinjo gima Joshua notimone Jeriko kod Ai, <verse eid="JOS 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 9:4"/>negiparo mondo giwuonde. Negidhi kaka jogo man-gi punde motingʼo ogunde moti gi piende divai moti kendo obaw. <verse eid="JOS 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 9:5"/>Jogi norwako wuoch moyiech kod lewni moti. Makati mane gin-go duto nokethore. <verse eid="JOS 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 9:6"/>Eka negidhi ir Joshua e kambi man Gilgal mi giwachone Joshua kod jo-Israel niya, “Wawuok e piny mabor, omiyo yie watim kodu winjruok.”<verse eid="JOS 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 9:7"/>Jo-Israel nowacho ni jo-Hivi niya, “To ka dipo ni udak kodwa machiegni, ere kaka dwa los kodu winjruok?”<verse eid="JOS 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 9:8"/>Negiwachone Joshua niya, “Wan jotichu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 9:8">To Joshua nopenjogi niya, “Un ngʼa gini to bende ua kanye?”<verse eid="JOS 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 9:9"/>Negidwoko niya, “Jotichni oa e piny mabor ahinya nikech humb Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachi. Wasewinjo humb gik mane otimo Misri, <verse eid="JOS 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 9:10"/>kendo gigo duto mane otimone ruodhi ariyo mag jo-Amor man yo wuok chiengʼ mar aora Jordan, ma gin Sihon ruodh Heshbon kod Og ruodh Bashan, mane odak Ashtaroth. <verse eid="JOS 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 9:11"/>Omiyo jodongwa kod ji duto modak e pinywa nowachonwa kama, ‘Kawuru gik mudhiyo godo e wuoth, dhiuru kendo urom kodgi ma uwachnegi niya, “Wan jotiju, losuru kodwa winjruok.” ’ <verse eid="JOS 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 9:12"/>Neuru makati mwatingʼogi, ne giliet ka wachako wuoth, to koro sani gikethore. <verse eid="JOS 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 9:13"/>Piend divai mane wapongʼo bende ne nyien, to koro neye kaka giyiech. Lepwa kod wuochewa bende oseti nikech wuoth marabora ahinya.”<verse eid="JOS 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 9:14"/>Jotelo moko mag jo-Israel nobilo chiemb jogo ka ok gipenjo Jehova Nyasaye wach. <verse eid="JOS 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 9:15"/>Omiyo Joshua noketo winjruok mar kwe kodgi mondo oyienegi gidag kodgi, kendo jotelo ne opwodho ma ka gikwongʼore.<verse eid="JOS 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 9:16"/>Ndalo adek bangʼ kane giseloso winjruok gi jo-Gibeon, jo-Israel nowinjo ni jogo gin mana joma odak kodgi machiegni. <verse eid="JOS 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 9:17"/>Omiyo jo-Israel nowuok, to odiechiengʼ mar adek negichopo e miechgi madongo kaka: Gibeon, Kefira, Beeroth, kod Kiriath Jearim. <verse eid="JOS 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 9:18"/>Jo-Israel ne ok omonjogi, nikech jotend kambi nosesingore ka kwongʼore kodgi e nyim Jehova Nyasaye, ma Nyasach jo-Israel.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 9:18">Kata kamano, ji duto nongʼur gi jotendgi, <verse eid="JOS 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 9:19"/>to jotelogo duto nowacho niya, “Wasemiyogi singruok marwa e nying Jehova Nyasaye, ma Nyasach Israel, omiyo koro ok wanyal mulogi. <verse eid="JOS 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 9:20"/>Ma e gima wabiro timonegi: ‘Wabiro wegi gidagi mondo kik mirima bi kuomwa nikech waketho kwongʼruok mane wasingonegi.’ ” <verse eid="JOS 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 9:21"/>Negidhi nyime kagiwacho niya, “Wegi gidagi, mondo gibednwa jobar yien gi joumb pi ni jowa duto.” Omiyo jotelo norito singruok margi.<verse eid="JOS 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 9:22"/>Eka Joshua noluongo jo-Gibeon kendo owachonegi niya, “Angʼo momiyo ne uwuondowa ka uwacho ni, ‘Wadak mochwalore kodu,’ to kuom adier udak mana butwa? <verse eid="JOS 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 9:23"/>Un joma okwongʼ! Ok unuwe tiyonwa kaka jobar yien gi joumb pi e od Nyasacha.”<verse eid="JOS 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 9:24"/>Negidwoko Joshua niya, “Jotichni notimo kamano nikech Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachi nochiko Musa jatichne mondo omiu pinyni duto kendo uneg ji duto modakie. Omiyo ne waluor nikech un, kendo mano ema nomiyo watimo kamano. <verse eid="JOS 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 9:25"/>Koro to wan e lweti. Timnwauru gimoro amora muneno ni ber kendo longʼonu.”<verse eid="JOS 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 9:26"/>Omiyo Joshua nokonyogi kuom jo-Israel ma ok ginegogi. <verse eid="JOS 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 9:27"/>E odiechiengʼno noketo jo-Gibeon obedo jobar yien gi joumb pi ni jo-Israel duto kendo ni tich kendo mar misango mar Jehova Nyasaye kama Jehova Nyasaye biro yiero. Kendo mano e gima gin nyaka chil kawuono.<verse eid="JOS 9:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JOS 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Chiengʼ ochungʼ kar tiende</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 10:1"/>Eka Adoni-Zedek ruodh Jerusalem nowinjo ni Joshua osekawo Ai mi okethe chuth kendo onego ruodhe mana kaka nosetimone Jeriko kendo ni jo-Gibeon osetimo winjruok mar kwe gi jo-Israel mi gidak butgi. <verse eid="JOS 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 10:2"/>En gi joge ne gibuok ahinya kuom wachni nikech Gibeon ne en dala maduongʼ mongirore, mana kaka achiel kuom mier madongo maka ruoth. Ne oduongʼ moloyo Ai, kendo joge duto ne gin jokedo mabeyo. <verse eid="JOS 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 10:3"/>Omiyo Adoni-Zedek ruodh Jerusalem nokwayo Hoham, ruodh Hebron, Piram ruodh Jarmuth, Jafia ruodh Lakish kod Debir ruodh Eglon niya, <verse eid="JOS 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 10:4"/>“Biuru mondo ukonya monjo Gibeon nikech oseloso kwe kod Joshua gi jo-Israel.”<verse eid="JOS 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 10:5"/>Eka ruodhi abich mar jo-Amor; ruodhi ma Jerusalem, Hebron, Jarmuth, Lakish to gi Eglon noriwo jolwenjgi kaachiel. Negidhi kod jolweny mag-gi mi gimonjo Gibeon kendo gikedo kodgi.<verse eid="JOS 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 10:6"/>Jo-Gibeon nooro wach ni Joshua e kambi man Gilgal niya, “Kik ijwangʼ jotichgi. Bi irwa piyo mondo ireswa! Konywa nikech ruodhi jo-Amor duto moa e piny manie wi got oseriwore mondo omonjwa.”<verse eid="JOS 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 10:7"/>Omiyo Joshua kaachiel gi jolweny mage mathuondi nowuok Gilgal mapiyo nono mondo odhi oresgi. <verse eid="JOS 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 10:8"/>Jehova Nyasaye nowachone Joshua niya, “Kik iluorgi; asechiwogi e lwetu. Onge kata ngʼata achiel kuomgi mabiro sirou.”<verse eid="JOS 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 10:9"/>Kane gisewuotho otieno duto ka gia Gilgal, Joshua nomonjogi apoya. <verse eid="JOS 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 10:10"/>Jehova Nyasaye nomiyo gichalo joma orundore e nyim jo-Israel, mine giloyogi gi loch maduongʼ e Gibeon. Jo-Israel nolawogi ka giluwo yo madhi Beth Horon mi ginegogi ma gichopo kodgi nyaka Azeka kod Makeda. <verse eid="JOS 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 10:11"/>E kinde mane giringo e nyim jo-Israel e yo moa Beth Horon kadhi Azeka, Jehova Nyasaye nolwaro pe madongo kuomgi koa e polo kendo thothgi nomedo tho nikech peno nonego ji mangʼeny moloyo mago mane jo-Israel onego gi ligangla.<verse eid="JOS 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 10:12"/>E odiechiengʼ mane Jehova Nyasaye ochiwo jo-Amor ni jo-Israel, Joshua nowachone Jehova Nyasaye e nyim jo-Israel niya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOS 10:12">“Yaye wangʼ chiengʼ, chungʼ kar tiendi ewi Gibeon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOS 10:12">to in dwe, chungʼ mana ewi holo mar Aijalon.”<verse eid="JOS 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 10:13"/>Omiyo wangʼ chiengʼ nochungʼ kar tiende,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOS 10:13">to dwe bende ne ok osudo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOS 10:13">nyaka oganda mar jo-Israel nochulo kuor kuom wasikgi,</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JOS 10:13">mana kaka nondike e Kitap Jashar.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 10:13">Wangʼ chiengʼ nosiko kochungʼ e polo kuom thuolo madirom odiechiengʼ achiel. <verse eid="JOS 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 10:14"/>Onge odiechiengʼ machal gi ma manosebetie ma Jehova Nyasaye nowinje kwayo mar dhano. Adier, adier Jehova Nyasaye ne kedo ni jo-Israel!<verse eid="JOS 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 10:15"/>Bangʼe Joshua noduogo gi jo-Israel duto e kambi man Gilgal.<verse eid="JOS 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ruodhi abich mag Amor onegi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 10:16"/>Koro ruodhi abichgo noringo kendo gipondo e rogo mantiere Makeda. <verse eid="JOS 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 10:17"/>Kane owach ne Joshua ni ruodhi abichgo nopondo e rogo mar Makeda, <verse eid="JOS 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 10:18"/>nowacho niya, “Dinuru dho rogono gi kidi maduongʼ kendo uket jomoko kanyo mondo orite. <verse eid="JOS 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 10:19"/>Un to kik uchungʼ kanyo, lawuru wasiku, monjgiuru kua gichien kendo kik uwegi gichop e miechgi madongo, nikech Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu osechiwogi e lwetu.”<verse eid="JOS 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 10:20"/>Omiyo Joshua kod jo-Israel notiekogi chuth makmana joma tin ema nodongʼ e miechgi madongo mochiel kod ohinga. <verse eid="JOS 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 10:21"/>Jolweny duto noduogo ir Joshua e kambi man Makeda maonge hinyruok moro, kendo onge ngʼama nowuoyo marach kuom jo-Israel.<verse eid="JOS 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 10:22"/>Joshua nowacho niya, “Yawuru dho rogono kendo ugol ruodhi abichgo oko mi ukelgi ira.” <verse eid="JOS 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 10:23"/>Omiyo negigolo ruodhi abichgo oko mi gikelogi, ne gin ruodh Jerusalem, Hebron, Jarmuth, Lakish kod Eglon. <verse eid="JOS 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 10:24"/>Kane gisekelo ruodhigi ne Joshua, noluongo jo-Israel duto kendo owachone jotend lweny mane obiro kode niya, “Biuru ka kendo unyon ngʼut ruodhigi.” Omiyo negibiro mi ginyono ngʼutgi piny.<verse eid="JOS 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 10:25"/>Joshua nowachonegi niya, “Kik uluor, kendo kik chunyu nyosre. Beduru motegno kendo gi chir. Ma e gima Jehova Nyasaye biro timo ne wasigu duto ma ubiro kedogo.” <verse eid="JOS 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 10:26"/>Bangʼe Joshua nomonjogi mi onego ruodhigo kendo olierogi e yien abich. Nowegi ka giliero e yiendego nyaka odhiambo.<verse eid="JOS 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 10:27"/>Kane chiengʼ osepodho, Joshua nogolo chik mondo olor ringregi e yiende mane oliergie kendo odirgi e rogo kama negisepondoe. Negidino dho rogono gi kite madongo, ma pod ni kanyo nyaka chil kawuono.<verse eid="JOS 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 10:28"/>E odiechiengno Joshua nokawo Makeda. Notieko dala maduongʼno kod ruodhe gi ligangla kendo otieko ngʼato angʼata mane ni e iye. Onge ngʼama notony kanyo. Notimone ruodh Makeda mana kaka notimone ruodh Jeriko.<verse eid="JOS 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Olo mier madongo man milambo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 10:29"/>Eka Joshua kod jo-Israel duto mane ni kode nodhi Libna koa Makeda mi omonje. <verse eid="JOS 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 10:30"/>Jehova Nyasaye nochiwo dala maduongʼni bende kod ruodhe e lwet jo-Israel. Dala maduongʼni to gi jogo duto modak e iye Joshua nonego gi ligangla. Onge ngʼama notony kanyo. Notimone ruodhgi mana kaka notimone ruodh Jeriko.<verse eid="JOS 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 10:31"/>Eka Joshua kod jo-Israel duto mane ni kode nodhi Lakish koa Libna; mi gimonje. <verse eid="JOS 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 10:32"/>Jehova Nyasaye nochiwo Lakish ne jo-Israel, to Joshua to ne okawe e odiechiengʼ mar ariyo. Dala maduongʼno kod ji duto modak kanyo nonego gi ligangla, mana kaka ne otimone Libna. <verse eid="JOS 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 10:33"/>Kuom mano, Horam ruodh Gezer nobiro mondo okony Lakish, to Joshua noloye kaachiel gi jolweny mage maonge ngʼama notony.<verse eid="JOS 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 10:34"/>Eka Joshua gi jo-Israel mane ni kode nodhi Eglon koa Lakish mi gimonje. <verse eid="JOS 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 10:35"/>Ne gikawe odiechiengʼ nogono mi ginego ji duto kendo giketho gimoro amora mangima manie iye, mana kaka negisetimone Lakish.<verse eid="JOS 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 10:36"/>Eka Joshua gi jo-Israel mane ni kode nodhi Hebron koa Eglon, mi gimonje. <verse eid="JOS 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 10:37"/>Negikawo dala maduongʼno mi ginego ruodhe kod gimoro amora mangima mane ni kuno kaachiel gi mago mane nitie e mier matindo mokiewo kode. Onge ngʼama notony, mana kaka ne otimone Eglon.<verse eid="JOS 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 10:38"/>Eka Joshua gi jo-Israel mane ni kode noduogo mi omonjo Debir. <verse eid="JOS 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 10:39"/>Negikawo dala maduongʼno, ruodhe kod mier matindo mokiewo kode mi ginegogi. Ji duto mane odak kanyo negitieko chuth kendo onge joma notony. Negitimone Debir kod ruodhe mana kaka negitimone Libna gi ruodhe, to gi Hebron.<verse eid="JOS 10:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 10:40"/>Omiyo Joshua nokawo gwengʼno duto kaachiel gi piny manie got ma en Negev, e tiend gode ma yo podho chiengʼ, to gi kuonde mag pewe kaachiel gi ruodhigi duto. Onge joma notony. Notieko jogo duto mangima, mana kaka Jehova Nyasaye, ma Nyasach Israel, nosechiko. <verse eid="JOS 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 10:41"/>Joshua nokawogi koa Kadesh Barnea nyaka Gaza kendo koa e gwenge duto ma Goshen nyaka Gibeon. <verse eid="JOS 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 10:42"/>Joshua nomako ruodhigo duto kaachiel gi pinjegi e lweny achielno nimar Jehova Nyasaye, ma Nyasach Israel, nokedo ni joge.<verse eid="JOS 10:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 10:43"/>Bangʼe Joshua noduogo gi jo-Israel duto e kambi man Gilgal.<verse eid="JOS 10:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JOS 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Olo ruodhi ma yo nyandwat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 11:1"/>Kane Jabin ruodh Hazor owinjo ma, nooro wach ne Jobab ma ruodh Madon, kod ruodhi mag Shimron gi Akshaf, <verse eid="JOS 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 11:2"/>kod ruodhi mae piny gode ma yo nyandwat e Araba ma milambo mar Kinereth, e tiend gode ma yo podho chiengʼ kod e Nafoth Dor mantiere yo podho chiengʼ. <verse eid="JOS 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 11:3"/>Nooro wach bende ni jo-Kanaan man yo wuok chiengʼ kod podho chiengʼ, kaachiel gi jo-Amor, jo-Hiti, jo-Perizi, kod jo-Jebus mantiere e piny gode; kendo ni jo-Hivi modak e tiend got Hermon e gwenge mag Mizpa. <verse eid="JOS 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 11:4"/>Ne giwuok gi jolweny mangʼeny ka kuoyo manie dho nam ka gin-gi farese kod geche lweny mangʼeny. <verse eid="JOS 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 11:5"/>Ruodhigi duto noriwo tekogi mi gichokore kanyakla e Sokni mag Merom, mondo giked gi jo-Israel.<verse eid="JOS 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 11:6"/>Jehova Nyasaye nowachone Joshua niya, “Kik uluorgi, nikech kiny sa machalo kama abiro chiwogi duto ne jo-Israel mi gineg-gi. Nyaka ungʼad odond tiend faresegi kendo uwangʼ gechegi.”<verse eid="JOS 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 11:7"/>Omiyo Joshua gi jolwenje duto nobiro momonjogi apoya e Sokni mag Merom mi gikedo kodgi, <verse eid="JOS 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 11:8"/>kendo Jehova Nyasaye nochiwogi e lwet jo-Israel. Negiloyogi mi gilawogi nyaka dala maduongʼ mar Sidon, nyaka Misrefoth Maim kendo nyaka Holo mar Mizpa ma yo wuok chiengʼ, maonge joma notony. <verse eid="JOS 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 11:9"/>Joshua notimonigi kaka Jehova Nyasaye nosechiko. Nongʼado odond tiend farese kendo nowangʼo gechegi.<verse eid="JOS 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 11:10"/>E sechego Joshua noduogo mi okawo Hazor kendo onego ruodhe kod ligangla. Hazor ema ne jatend pinjegi duto. <verse eid="JOS 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 11:11"/>Ji duto mane ni e dala maduongʼno noneg gi ligangla. Negitiekogi pep maonge gima yweyo mane odongʼ, Hazor bende ne giwangʼo.<verse eid="JOS 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 11:12"/>Joshua nokawo mier madongo gi ruodhigi mi ginegogi gi ligangla. Notiekogi pep, mana kaka Musa jatich Jehova Nyasaye nosechiko. <verse eid="JOS 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 11:13"/>Kata kamano, jo-Israel ne ok owangʼo dala maduongʼ moro amora moger e gode mag-gi matindo makmana Hazor ma Joshua nowangʼo. <verse eid="JOS 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 11:14"/>Jo-Israel noyako gik moko duto kod kweth jamni mag mier madongogi, kendo neginego ji duto maonge ngʼama notony kata achiel. <verse eid="JOS 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 11:15"/>Kaka Jehova Nyasaye nochiwo chik ni jatichne Musa, omiyo Musa bende nochiwo chik ne Joshua, mi Joshua notimo mano. Onge gima noweyo ma ok otimo kuom gigo duto mane Jehova Nyasaye ochiko Musa.<verse eid="JOS 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 11:16"/>Omiyo Joshua nokawo pinyni duto; kaka, piny manie got, piny Negev duto, gwenge duto mag Goshen, tiend gode ma yo podho chiengʼ, Araba kod gode duto mag Israel kaachiel gi pewe mag <verse eid="JOS 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 11:17"/>Got Halak, machakore yo Seir, nyaka Baal Gad manie Holo mar Lebanon manie Got Hermon. Nomako ruodhigi duto mi onegogi. <verse eid="JOS 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 11:18"/>Joshua nokedo gi ruodhigi duto kuom ndalo mangʼeny. <verse eid="JOS 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 11:19"/>Onge dala maduongʼ moro amora mane otimo winjruok gi jo-Israel makmana jo-Hivi modak Gibeon. Joma odongʼ duto negikedogo. <verse eid="JOS 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 11:20"/>Jehova Nyasaye owuon ema ne omiyo chunygi obedo matek mondo gitug lweny gi jo-Israel kendo mondo jo-Israel otiekgi chuth maonge ngʼwono mana kaka Jehova Nyasaye nosechiko Musa.<verse eid="JOS 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 11:21"/>E ndalono mane Joshua odhi kendo otieko jo-Anak moa e piny gode, ema bende notieke joma odak, Hebron, Debir kod Anab, mago moa e pinje gode mag Juda, to gi moa e pinje gode mag Israel. Joshua notiekogi duto kod miechgi. <verse eid="JOS 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 11:22"/>Onge jo-Anak mane odongʼ e piny jo-Israel; makmana joma nodongʼ Gaza, Gath kod Ashdod. <verse eid="JOS 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 11:23"/>Omiyo Joshua nokawo pinyno duto mana kaka Jehova Nyasaye nosechiko Musa, mi nochiwe kaka girkeni ni jo-Israel kaluwore gi migepe mag dhoutegi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 11:23">Bangʼe pinyni nobedo gi kwe.<verse eid="JOS 11:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JOS 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Nying ruodhi mane olo</para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 12:1"/>Magi e ruodhi mag pinje mane jo-Israel oloyo kendo mane gikawo gwengegi ma yo wuok chiengʼ mar aora Jordan, kochakore e holo mar Arnon nyaka e Got Hermon, moriwo nyaka yo wuok chiengʼ mar Araba.<verse eid="JOS 12:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 12:2"/>Negiloyo Sihon ma ruodh jo-Amor manodak Heshbon.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JOS 12:2">Pinye nochakore Aroer man but holo mar Arnon koluwo holono nyaka e Aora Jabok, manie tongʼ mar jo-Amon. Ma noriwo nyaka nus mar Gilead.<verse eid="JOS 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 12:3"/>Bende norito yo wuok chiengʼ mar Araba kochakore e Nam mar Kinereth nyaka e Nam mar Araba (tiende ni, Nam Chumbi), to nyaka Beth Jeshimoth, bangʼe nyaka yo milambo e tiend gode mag Pisga.<verse eid="JOS 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 12:4"/>Kendo gwenge mag Og ruodh Bashan, achiel kuom mago mogik mag jo-Refai, ma lochne ne nitie Ashtaroth kod Edrei.<verse eid="JOS 12:4"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 12:5"/>Norito Got Hermon, Saleka, Bashan duto, nyaka e tongʼ mar jo-Geshur gi Maaka, kendo gi nus mar Gilead nyaka e tongʼ-gi gi Sihon, ruodh Heshbon.<verse eid="JOS 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 12:6"/>Musa, jatich Jehova Nyasaye kod jo-Israel noloyogi kendo Musa ma jatich Jehova Nyasaye nochiwo pinygino ne jo-Reuben, jo-Gad gi nus mar dhood Manase mondo obed kaka girkeni mag-gi.<verse eid="JOS 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 12:7"/>Magi e ruodhi mag pinyno mane Joshua kod jo-Israel oloyo yo podho chiengʼ mar aora Jordan, kochakore Baal Gad mantie e Holo mar Lebanon nyaka Got Halak mochakore yo Seir. Pinjegi duto Joshua nochiwo kaka girkeni ni dhout Israel kaluwore gi dhoutgi kaka opog-gi mondo obed mag-gi. <verse eid="JOS 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 12:8"/>Ne en piny gode, gi pinje mantiere e tiend gode ma yo podho chiengʼ, Araba, pewe manie tiend gode, gi thim kod Negev. Kuondego ema ne jo-Hiti, jo-Amor, jo-Kanaan, jo-Perizi, jo-Hivi kod jo-Jebus odakie.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JOS 12:8"/>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 12:8">Ruodhigo ne gin:<verse eid="JOS 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 12:9"/>Ruodh Jeriko, ngʼato achiel,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 12:9">Ruodh Ai (machiegni gi Bethel), ngʼato achiel,<verse eid="JOS 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 12:10"/>Ruodh Jerusalem, ngʼato achiel,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 12:10">Ruodh Hebron, ngʼato achiel,<verse eid="JOS 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 12:11"/>Ruodh Jarmuth, ngʼato achiel,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 12:11">Ruodh Lakish, ngʼato achiel,<verse eid="JOS 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 12:12"/>Ruodh Eglon, ngʼato achiel,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 12:12">Ruodh Gezer, ngʼato achiel,<verse eid="JOS 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 12:13"/>Ruodh Debir, ngʼato achiel,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 12:13">Ruodh Geder, ngʼato achiel,<verse eid="JOS 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 12:14"/>Ruodh Horma, ngʼato achiel,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 12:14">Ruodh Arad, ngʼato achiel,<verse eid="JOS 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 12:15"/>Ruodh Libna, ngʼato achiel,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 12:15">Ruodh Adulam, ngʼato achiel<verse eid="JOS 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 12:16"/>Ruodh Makeda, ngʼato achiel,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 12:16">Ruodh Bethel, ngʼato achiel,<verse eid="JOS 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 12:17"/>Ruodh Tapua, ngʼato achiel,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 12:17">Ruodh Hefer, ngʼato achiel,<verse eid="JOS 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 12:18"/>Ruodh Afek, ngʼato achiel,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 12:18">Ruodh Lasharon, ngʼato achiel,<verse eid="JOS 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 12:19"/>Ruodh Madon, ngʼato achiel,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 12:19">Ruodh Hazor, ngʼato achiel,<verse eid="JOS 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 12:20"/>Ruodh Shimron Meron, ngʼato achiel,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 12:20">Ruodh Akshaf, ngʼato achiel,<verse eid="JOS 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 12:21"/>Ruodh Tanak, ngʼato achiel,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 12:21">Ruodh Megido, ngʼato achiel,<verse eid="JOS 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 12:22"/>Ruodh Kedesh, ngʼato achiel,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 12:22">Ruodh Jokneam man Karmel, ngʼato achiel,<verse eid="JOS 12:22"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 12:23"/>Ruodh Dor (man Nafoth Dor), ngʼato achiel,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 12:23">Ruodh Goyim man Gilgal, ngʼato achiel,<verse eid="JOS 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 12:24"/>kod Ruodh Tirza, ngʼato achiel.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JOS 12:24"/>
  <para style="li4" vid="JOS 12:24">Ruodhi duto mane onegi ne oromo piero adek gachiel.<verse eid="JOS 12:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JOS 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Kuonde mapok okaw e piny Kanaan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 13:1"/>Ka Joshua noseti kendo hike koro noniangʼ, Jehova Nyasaye nowachone niya, “Iseti ahinya, to pod nitie kuonde madongo mar pinyni monego kaw.<verse eid="JOS 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 13:2"/>“Kuonde modongʼ mapok okaw e magi:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JOS 13:2"/>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 13:2">“gwenge duto mag jo-Filistia gi jo-Geshur, <verse eid="JOS 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 13:3"/>kochakore e Aora Shihor man yo wuok chiengʼ mar Misri nyaka e tongʼ Ekron man yo nyandwat, magi duto nokwan kaka jo-Kanaan. Kuonde mane jotelo abich mag Filistia orito ne gin, Gaza, Ashdod, Ashkelon, Gath kod Ekron;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 13:3">magi ne gin mag jo-Avi <verse eid="JOS 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 13:4"/>yo milambo;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 13:4">pinje duto mag jo-Kanaan, kochakore Meara mar jo-Sidonia nyaka ochopo Afek, gi tongʼ mar jo-Amor;<verse eid="JOS 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 13:5"/>e gwenge mag Gebal;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 13:5">to gi Lebanon duto ma yo wuok chiengʼ, kaachiel gi Baal Gad manie tiend Got Hermon nyaka Lebo Hamath.<verse eid="JOS 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 13:6"/>“Ne jogo duto modak kuonde motimo gode chakre Lebanon nyaka Misrefoth Maim, tiende ni, jo-Sidonia duto, an awuon abiro riembogi mondo giwene jo-Israel. Beduru gi adieri mar pogo ni jo-Israel pinyni kaka girkeni margi, mana kaka asechikoi. <verse eid="JOS 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 13:7"/>Pogeuru kaka girkeni ni dhoudi ochikogo, kaachiel gi nus joka Manase.”<verse eid="JOS 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pok mar piny ma yo wuok chiengʼ mar Aora Jordan</para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 13:8"/>Nus modongʼ mar joka Manase, gi jo-Reuben kod jo-Gad noseyudo girkeni mag-gi mane Musa jatich Jehova Nyasaye osemiyogi yo wuok chiengʼ mar aora Jordan.<verse eid="JOS 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 13:9"/>Nochakore Aroer koluwore gi holo mar Arnon, kendo koluwore gi dalano manie dier holono, mi oriwo gode duto mag Medeba mochopo nyaka Dibon, <verse eid="JOS 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 13:10"/>bende nyaka mier matindo mar Sihon ruodh jo-Amor, mane jatelo Heshbon, mantiere e tongʼ mar jo-Amon.<verse eid="JOS 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 13:11"/>Noriwo nyaka Gilead, gwenge jo-Geshur kod jo-Maaka, Got Hermon duto, kod Bashan duto, mochopo nyaka Saleka, <verse eid="JOS 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 13:12"/>tiende ni, pinyruodh Og duto man Bashan, ma bende nosebedo gi loch e Ashtaroth gi Edrei. (To bende nobedo achiel kuom jo-Refai mogik.) Musa noloyogi mi okawo pinygi. <verse eid="JOS 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 13:13"/>Makmana jo-Israel ne ok oriembo jo-Geshur gi jo-Maaka, omiyo pod gidak e dier jo-Israel nyaka chil kawuono.<verse eid="JOS 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 13:14"/>To dhood Lawi ne ok omiyo girkeni, nikech chiwo mane ochiw kokalo e mach ne Jehova Nyasaye, ma Nyasach Israel e girkeni margi, mana kaka ne osingonigi.<verse eid="JOS 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 13:15"/>Girkeni mane Musa omiyo dhood Reuben kaluwore gi anywola ka anywola e magi:<verse eid="JOS 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 13:16"/>Tongʼ mar pinygi nochakore Aroer man but holo mar Arnon, kendo koa e dalano mantiere e dier holono nyaka Medeba, <verse eid="JOS 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 13:17"/>gi Heshbon kaachiel gi mier matindo mantiere e pewe, kaka Dibon, Bamoth Baal, Beth Baal Meon, <verse eid="JOS 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 13:18"/>Jahaz, Kedemoth, Mefath, <verse eid="JOS 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 13:19"/>Kiriathaim, Sibma, Zereth Shahar mantiere e got manie holo, <verse eid="JOS 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 13:20"/>Beth Peor, pewe mag Pisga, kod Beth Jeshimoth, <verse eid="JOS 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 13:21"/>mier matindo duto mantiere e pewe kod kuonde duto mag Sihon ruodh jo-Amor, ma bende norito Heshbon. Musa noseloyo Sihon ruodh jo-Amor kaachiel gi Evi, Rekem, Zur, Hur gi Reba mane jodong jo-Midian. Jodongogo nodak e pinyno ka gin e bwo loch Sihon. <verse eid="JOS 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 13:22"/>Koriwore gi jogo mane onegi e lweny, jo-Israel nonego bende Balaam wuod Beor, mane ja-nyakalondo.<verse eid="JOS 13:22"/></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 13:23"/>Aora Jordan ema nobedo tongʼ mar joka Reuben. Pinyno kaachiel gi mier matindo mokiewo kodgi nobedo girkeni mar joka Reuben.<verse eid="JOS 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 13:24"/>Girkeni mane Musa omiyo dhood Gad kaluwore gi anywola margi e magi:<verse eid="JOS 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 13:25"/>Piny Jazer, mier matindo duto mag Gilead kod nus mar jo-Amon mochopo Aroer machiegni gi Raba; <verse eid="JOS 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 13:26"/>kendo chakre Heshbon nyaka Ramath Mizpa gi Betonim, kendo kochakore Mahanaim nyaka piny Debir; <verse eid="JOS 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 13:27"/>to pinygi mane ni e holo notingʼo Beth Haram, Beth Nimra, Sukoth, Zafon kod bath piny Sihon ruodh Heshbon modongʼ (pinygino neni yo wuok chiengʼ mar aora Jordan kendo Jordan nyaka Nam Kinereth nodoko tongʼ mare).<verse eid="JOS 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 13:28"/>Pinyno kaachiel gi mier matindo mokiewo kodgi nobedo girkeni mar joka Gad.<verse eid="JOS 13:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 13:29"/>Girkeni mane Musa omiyo nus mar dhood Manase, tiende ni, nus mar nyikwa Manase, kaluwore gi anywola ka anywola.<verse eid="JOS 13:29"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 13:30"/>Pinygi nochakore Mahanaim, mokwako piny Og ruodh Bashan duto kod kuonde dak duto mag Jair man Bashan, to gi mier matindo piero auchiel, <verse eid="JOS 13:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 13:31"/>bende nokawo nus mar jo-Gilead, gi Ashtaroth kod Edrei (ma gin mier madongo mag Og ruodh Bashan).</para>
  <para style="li4" vid="JOS 13:31">Magi e pok mane omi nyikwa Makir wuod Manase, tiende ni nus mar dhood Makir konchiel.<verse eid="JOS 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 13:32"/>Ma e girkeni mane Musa ochiwo kane en e paw Moab nyaka loka aora Jordan, yo wuok chiengʼ mar Jeriko. <verse eid="JOS 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 13:33"/>To ni dhood Lawi, Musa ne ok opogonigi girkeni, nikech Jehova Nyasaye, ma Nyasach Israel, e girkeni margi, mana kaka nosesingonegi.<verse eid="JOS 13:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JOS 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Pok mar piny ma yo wuok chiengʼ mar Aora Jordan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 14:1"/>Koro magi e kuonde mane jo-Israel oyudo kaka girkeni e piny Kanaan, ma Eliazar jadolo, Joshua wuod Nun to gi jotend dhout Israel nopogonegi. <verse eid="JOS 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 14:2"/>Girkeni mag-gi nochiw kuom goyo ombulu ni dhoudi ochiko gi nus, kaka Jehova Nyasaye nosechiko kokalo kuom Musa. <verse eid="JOS 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 14:3"/>Musa nosepogo yo wuok chiengʼ mar aora Jordan ni dhoudi ariyo gi nus kaka girkeni, to ne ok opogo jo-Lawi girkeni e dier ogendini moko, <verse eid="JOS 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 14:4"/>nimar yawuot Josef ne osepogore mi obedo dhoudi ariyo ma gin, Manase gi Efraim. Jo-Lawi ne ok oyudo pok moro e pinyno makmana mier mag dak, to gi lege ma rombgi kod dhogi nyalo kwayoe. <verse eid="JOS 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 14:5"/>Omiyo jo-Israel nopogo pinyno mana kaka Jehova Nyasaye nosechiko Musa.<verse eid="JOS 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hebron omi Kaleb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 14:6"/>Eka jo-Juda nodhi ir Joshua Gilgal kendo Kaleb ma wuod Jefune ma ja-Kenizi nowachone niya, “Ingʼeyo gima Jehova Nyasaye nowachone Musa, ngʼat Nyasaye ka en Kadesh Barnea kuomi kod an. <verse eid="JOS 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 14:7"/>Ne an ja-higni piero angʼwen kinde mane Musa jatich Jehova Nyasaye noora ka aa Kadesh Barnea mondo anon pinyni, kendo naduogone wach kaka chunya noneno, <verse eid="JOS 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 14:8"/>to owetena mane odhi koda nokelo wach mane onyoso chuny ji. To kata kamano, an to naluwo Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasacha gi chunya duto. <verse eid="JOS 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 14:9"/>Omiyo odiechiengno Musa nokwongʼorena ni, ‘E pinyno matiendi osenyono biro bedo girkeni magi kendo gi nyithindi nyaka chiengʼ, nikech useluwo Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasacha gi chunyu duto.’ <verse eid="JOS 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 14:10"/>“Koro mana kaka Jehova Nyasaye nosingo, osemiya ngima kuom higni piero angʼwen gabich nyaka nowach ne Musa wachni, e kinde mane jo-Israel ne pod wuotho e thim. Omiyo Jehova Nyasaye oserito ngimana, makoro an gi higni piero aboro gabich! <verse eid="JOS 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 14:11"/>Kata kawuono pod ategno mana ka kinde mane Musa ooracha, kendo pod an-gi ilo mar dhi oko mondo akedi mana kaka ne an ndalo cha. <verse eid="JOS 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 14:12"/>Koro miya piny manie godni mane Jehova Nyasaye nosingona odiechiengʼ cha. In iwuon ni iwinjo ni jo-Anak ni kanyo kendo miechgi madongo ne lach kendo ochiel gohinga makmana Jehova Nyasaye kokonya to abiro riembogi oko mana kaka nowacho.”<verse eid="JOS 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 14:13"/>Eka Joshua nogwedho Kaleb wuod Jefune mi omiye Hebron kaka girkeni mare. <verse eid="JOS 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 14:14"/>Omiyo Hebron osebedo mar Kaleb wuod Jefune ma ja-Kenizi nyaka aa chiengʼno, nikech noluwo Jehova Nyasaye, Nyasach Israel, gi chunye duto. <verse eid="JOS 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 14:15"/>Chon ni luongo Hebron ni Kiriath Arba kaluwore gi Arba, mane jatelo maduongʼ e dier jo-Anak.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 14:15">Bangʼe pinyno nobedo gi kwe.<verse eid="JOS 14:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JOS 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Pok mar Juda</para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 15:1"/>Piny mane opog ni dhood Juda gi ombulu, kaluwore gi anywola margi, nochopo nyaka e gwenge mag Edom, kendo nyaka yo milambo e thim mar Zin.<verse eid="JOS 15:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 15:2"/>Tongʼ-gi ma yo milambo nochakore e giko mar Nam Chumbi ma yo milambo, <verse eid="JOS 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 15:3"/>kongʼado milambo mar Akrabim, kodhi nyime nyaka Zin, kendo ochwe nyaka milambo mar Kadesh Barnea. Bangʼe to ne ongʼado Hezron nyaka Adar kendo gomo kochiko Karka. <verse eid="JOS 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 15:4"/>Bangʼe ne okalo nyaka Azmon mi ochopo nyaka Wadi manie piny Misri kendo ochopo nyaka e dho Nam Mediterania. Ma e giko tongʼne ma yo milambo.<verse eid="JOS 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 15:5"/>Tongʼ-gi ma yo wuok chiengʼ nochakore Nam Chumbi modhi nyaka dho aora Jordan.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 15:5">Tongʼ-gi ma yo nyandwat nochakore kama aora Jordan donjogo e nam maduongʼ, <verse eid="JOS 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 15:6"/>modhi malo nyaka Beth Hogla kendo odhi nyime yo nyandwat mar Beth Araba nyaka e kite mag Bohan ma wuod Reuben. <verse eid="JOS 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 15:7"/>Tongʼno nodhi nyaka Debir koa e Holo mar Akor mi ogomo kochiko nyandwat nyaka Gilgal, mangʼiyore gi Pass mar Adumim mantiere yo milambo mar holono. Nodhi nyime koluwo dho aora mar En Shemesh mochopo nyaka En Rogel. <verse eid="JOS 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 15:8"/>Bangʼe noluwo Holo mar Ben Hinom, kochomo pewe ma milambo mar dala maduongʼ mar jo-Jebus (tiende ni, Jerusalem). Koa kanyo noidho nyaka ewi got man yo podho chiengʼ mar Holo mar Hinom e giko mar Holo mar Refaim mantiere yo nyandwat. <verse eid="JOS 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 15:9"/>Koa ewi got, tongʼno nochiko yo thidhna mag pige mag Neftoa, mowuok koa e mier matindo mag Got Efron kendo modhi nyaka Baala (tiende ni, Kiriath Jearim). <verse eid="JOS 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 15:10"/>Bangʼe tongʼno nogomo kochiko yo podho chiengʼ chakre Baala nyaka Got Seir, koluwo yo nyandwat mar pewe mag Got Jearim (tiende ni, Kesalon), modhi nyime nyaka Beth Shemesh kendo ongʼado nyaka Timna. <verse eid="JOS 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 15:11"/>Nodhi nyaka yo nyandwat manie pewe mar Ekron kendo ogomo kochiko Shikeron, mi okalo nyaka Got Baala kendo ochopo Jabnel. Tongʼno nochopo nyaka e nam.<verse eid="JOS 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 15:12"/>Tongʼ ma yo podho chiengʼ nochopo nyaka e dho Nam Maduongʼ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JOS 15:12"/>
  <para style="li4" vid="JOS 15:12">Magi e tongʼ mar jo-Juda kaluwore gi anywolagi.<verse eid="JOS 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bath piny Juda momi Kaleb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 15:13"/>Kaluwore gi chik mane Jehova Nyasaye omiyo Joshua, nomiyo Kaleb wuod Jefune bath piny Juda miluongo ni, Kiriath Arba, ma tiende ni, Hebron. (Arba ne en kwar Anak.) <verse eid="JOS 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 15:14"/>Kochakore Hebron, Kaleb noriembo jo-Anak adek, ma gin Sheshai, Ahiman kod Talmai ma gin nyikwa Anak. <verse eid="JOS 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 15:15"/>Koa kanyo nodhi momonjo joma odak Debir (machon ne iluongo ni Kiriath Sefa). <verse eid="JOS 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 15:16"/>To Kaleb nowacho niya, “Anachiw nyara Aksa mondo okendi gi ngʼatno manoked ma kaw Kiriath Sefa.” <verse eid="JOS 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 15:17"/>Othniel wuod Kenaz, ma owadgi Kaleb noloyo pinyno, omiyo Kaleb nomiye nyare Aksa mondo okendi.<verse eid="JOS 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 15:18"/>Chiengʼ moro achiel kane obiro ir Othniel, nojiwe mondo okwa wuon mare puodho. Kane olor oa e pundane, Kaleb nopenje niya, “En angʼo midwaro ni mondo atimni?”<verse eid="JOS 15:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 15:19"/>Nodwoko niya, “Timna ngʼwono makende. Nimar isemiya puodho man Negev, miya bende thidhna mar pi.” Omiyo Kaleb nomiye thidhna ma malo kod mamwalo.<verse eid="JOS 15:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 15:20"/>Ma e girkeni mar dhood Juda, kaluwore gi anywolagi.<verse eid="JOS 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 15:21"/>Mier matindo man yo podho chiengʼ ma nopogne dhood Juda man Negev kaachiel gi mago mogo tongʼ gi Edom ne gin:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JOS 15:21">Kabzel, Eder, Jagur, <verse eid="JOS 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 15:22"/>Kina, Dimona, Adada, <verse eid="JOS 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 15:23"/>Kedesh, Hazor, Ithnan, <verse eid="JOS 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 15:24"/>Zif, Telem, Biloth, <verse eid="JOS 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 15:25"/>Hazor Hadata, Kerioth Hezron (tiende ni, Hazor), <verse eid="JOS 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 15:26"/>Amam, Shema, Molada, <verse eid="JOS 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 15:27"/>Hazar Gada, Heshmon, Beth Pelet, <verse eid="JOS 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 15:28"/>Hazar Shual, Bersheba, Biziothia, <verse eid="JOS 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 15:29"/>Baala, Iyim, Ezem, <verse eid="JOS 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 15:30"/>Eltolad, Kesil, Horma, <verse eid="JOS 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 15:31"/>Ziklag, Madmana, Sansana, <verse eid="JOS 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 15:32"/>Lebaoth, Shilhim, Ain kod Rimon. Giduto ne gin mier gi gwenge maromo piero ariyo gochiko.<verse eid="JOS 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 15:33"/>To mier mane nitiere e tiend gode ma yo podho chiengʼ ne gin:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JOS 15:33">Eshtaol, Zora, Ashna, <verse eid="JOS 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 15:34"/>Zanoa, En Ganim, Tapua, Enam, <verse eid="JOS 15:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 15:35"/>Jarmuth, Adulam, Soko, Azeka, <verse eid="JOS 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 15:36"/>Sharaim, Adithaim, kod Gedera (kata Gederothaim). Giduto ne gin mier gi gwenge maromo apar gangʼwen.<verse eid="JOS 15:36"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 15:37"/>Mier mamoko ne gin: Zenan, Hadasha, Migdal Gad, <verse eid="JOS 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 15:38"/>Dilean, Mizpa, Jokthel, <verse eid="JOS 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 15:39"/>Lakish, Bozkath, Eglon, <verse eid="JOS 15:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 15:40"/>Kabon, Lamas, Kitlish, <verse eid="JOS 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 15:41"/>Gederoth, Beth Dagon, Naama kod Makeda. Giduto ne gin mier kod gwenge maromo apar gauchiel.<verse eid="JOS 15:41"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 15:42"/>Mier mamoko ne gin: Libna, Ether, Ashan, <verse eid="JOS 15:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 15:43"/>Ifta, Ashna, Nezib, <verse eid="JOS 15:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JOS 15:44"/>Keila, Akzib kod Maresha. Giduto ne gin mier gi gwenge maromo ochiko.<verse eid="JOS 15:44"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JOS 15:45"/>Ekron gi mier molworo bende ne margi. <verse eid="JOS 15:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JOS 15:46"/>Ashdod gi mier molwore bende ne margi kochakore yo podho chiengʼ mar Ekron. <verse eid="JOS 15:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JOS 15:47"/>Ashdod gi Gaza kod miechgi mochopo nyaka Wadi manie tongʼ-gi gi Misri, kendo koluwo nyaka dho Nam Maduongʼ bende ne margi.<verse eid="JOS 15:47"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JOS 15:48"/>Mier mamoko mane ni e got ne gin:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JOS 15:48">Shamir, Jatir, Soko, <verse eid="JOS 15:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JOS 15:49"/>Dana, Kiriath Sana (tiende ni, Debir), <verse eid="JOS 15:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JOS 15:50"/>Anab, Eshtemo, Anim, <verse eid="JOS 15:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JOS 15:51"/>Goshen, Holon, kod Gilo. Giduto ne gin mier kod gwenge maromo apar gachiel.<verse eid="JOS 15:51"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JOS 15:52"/>Mier mamoko ne gin: Arab, Duma, Eshan, <verse eid="JOS 15:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JOS 15:53"/>Janim, Beth Tapua, Afeka, <verse eid="JOS 15:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JOS 15:54"/>Humta, Kiriath Arba (tiende ni, Hebron), kod Zior. Giduto ne gin mier kod gwenge maromo ochiko.<verse eid="JOS 15:54"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JOS 15:55"/>Mier mamoko ne gin: Maon, Karmel, Zif, Juta, <verse eid="JOS 15:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JOS 15:56"/>Jezreel, Jokdeam, Zanoa, <verse eid="JOS 15:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JOS 15:57"/>Kain, Gibea, kod Timna. Giduto ne gin mier kod gwenge maromo apar.<verse eid="JOS 15:57"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JOS 15:58"/>Mier mamoko ne gin: Halhul, Beth Zur, Gedor, <verse eid="JOS 15:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JOS 15:59"/>Maarath, Beth Anoth kod Eltekon. Giduto ne gin mier kod gwenge maromo auchiel.<verse eid="JOS 15:59"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JOS 15:60"/>Mier mamoko ne gin: Kiriath Baal (tiende ni, Kiriath Jearim), kod Raba. Giduto ne gin mier kod gwenge maromo ariyo.<verse eid="JOS 15:60"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JOS 15:61"/>Mier mane giyudo e thim ne gin:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JOS 15:61">Beth Araba, Midin, Sekaka, <verse eid="JOS 15:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JOS 15:62"/>Nibshan, Dala Maduongʼ mar Chumbi, kod En Gedi. Giduto ne gin mier kod gwenge maromo auchiel.<verse eid="JOS 15:62"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="JOS 15:63"/>Jo-Juda ne ok nyal daro jo-Jebus, mane odak Jerusalem; jo-Jebus gi jo-Juda pod odak kanyo nyaka chil kawuono.<verse eid="JOS 15:63"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JOS 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Pok mar jo-Efraim gi jo-Manase</para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 16:1"/>Piny mane opog ne Josef nochakore Aora Jordan man yo wuok chiengʼ mar Jeriko, koluwo i thim mochopo e gode man Bethel. <verse eid="JOS 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 16:2"/>Nodhi nyime chakre Bethel (tiende ni, Luz), mi ongʼado gwengʼ jo-Arki mantiere Ataroth, <verse eid="JOS 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 16:3"/>koridore yo podho chiengʼ nyaka e tongʼ jo-Jaflet mochopo nyaka e holo mar Beth Horon kendo nyaka Gezer, mogik e nam.<verse eid="JOS 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 16:4"/>Omiyo Manase gi Efraim, ma nyikwa Josef, noyudo girkeni mag-gi.<verse eid="JOS 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 16:5"/>To piny Efraim kaluwore gi anywola ka anywola ema:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JOS 16:5"/>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 16:5">Tongʼ mar pinye mane girkeni mare nochakore Ataroth Adar, ma yo wuok chiengʼ nyaka Beth Horon Mamalo, <verse eid="JOS 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 16:6"/>kendo odhi nyime nyaka e nam. Bende kochakore Mikmethath mantiere yo nyandwat ne ogondore kochiko yo wuok chiengʼ nyaka Tanath Shilo, mochopo nyaka yo wuok chiengʼ mar Janoa. <verse eid="JOS 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 16:7"/>Eka nodhi piny kochakore Janoa nyaka Ataroth gi Naara, momulo Jeriko mokadho e aora Jordan. <verse eid="JOS 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 16:8"/>Kochakore gie tongʼ Tapua nodhi yo podho chiengʼ nyaka Kana Tavain kendo ogik e nam. Ma ema ne girkeni mar dhood Efraim, kaluwore gi anywolagi.<verse eid="JOS 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 16:9"/>Piny mane omi Efraim kaka girkenino bende notingʼo mier moko mane ni e gwengʼ Manase.<verse eid="JOS 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 16:10"/>Ne ok gidaro jo-Kanaan mane odak Gezer. Nyaka chil kawuono jo-Kanaan pod odak gi jo-Efraim ka gitiyonegi kaka wasumbinigi.<verse eid="JOS 16:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JOS 17"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 17:1"/>Ma e pok mar dhood Manase, kaka wuod Josef makayo, tiende ni, mar Makir, wuod Manase makayo. Makir ne kwar jo-Gilead, ma norwako Gilead gi Bashan nikech jo-Makir ne gin jolweny mongʼere. <verse eid="JOS 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 17:2"/>Omiyo pokni nowene joka Manase mane odongʼ, kaka, anywola mar Abiezer, Helek Asriel, Shekem, Hefer, kod Shemida. Magi e nyikwa Manase ma wuod Josef mamoko machwo kaluwore gi anywolagi.<verse eid="JOS 17:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 17:3"/>Zelofehad ma wuod Hefer, ma wuod Gilead, ma wuod Makir, ma wuod Manase, ne onge yawuowi makmana nyiri kende, ma nying-gi ne gin: Mala, Nowa, Hogla, Milka gi Tirza. <verse eid="JOS 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 17:4"/>Negidhi ir Eliazar jadolo kod Joshua wuod Nun, to gi jotelo mi giwachonegi niya, “Jehova Nyasaye nochiko Musa mondo opognwa girkeni e dier owetewa.” Omiyo Joshua nomiyogi girkeni kaachiel gi owete wuonegi, kaluwore gi chik Jehova Nyasaye. <verse eid="JOS 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 17:5"/>Pok mar Manase ne en lope apar kapok okwan piny Gilead kod piny Bashan mantiere yo wuok chiengʼ mar aora Jordan, <verse eid="JOS 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 17:6"/>nikech nyi dhood Manase noyudo girkeni e kind owetegi. Piny jo-Gilead nobedo mar nyikwa Manase mamoko.<verse eid="JOS 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 17:7"/>Piny Manase nochakore Asher nyaka Mikmethath mantiere yo wuok chiengʼ mar Shekem. Tongʼno nochakore yo milambo mokawo nyaka joma odak En Tapua. <verse eid="JOS 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 17:8"/>Manase nokawo piny Tapua, to Tapua owuon, mane nitiere e tongʼ Manase, nobedo mar jo-Efraim. <verse eid="JOS 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 17:9"/>Eka tongʼno nodhi nyime yo milambo mochopo nyaka Kana Ravin. Ne nitiere mier matindo ma mek Efraim mane nitiere e dier mier matindo mag Manase, makmana tongʼ Manase ne nitiere yo nyandwat mar holo matut madiny kendo mogik e nam. <verse eid="JOS 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 17:10"/>Yo milambo ne en piny Efraim, to yo nyandwat ne en mar Manase. Piny Manase nochopo e nam kendo mokiewo gi Asher yo nyandwat, to Isakar yo wuok chiengʼ.<verse eid="JOS 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 17:11"/>E Isakar kod Asher, Manase ne nitie bende kod Beth Shan, Ibleam kod jo-Dor, Endor, Tanak kod Megido, kaachiel gi jogo mane odak machiegni kodgi, ngʼat mar adek e kwan-no ne en Nafoth.<verse eid="JOS 17:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 17:12"/>Kata kamano, jo-Manase ne ok nyal kawo e mier matindogi, nikech jo-Kanaan noramo ni nyaka gidag kanyo. <verse eid="JOS 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 17:13"/>Omiyo ka jo-Israel nodoko maroteke, negiketo jo-Kanaan obedo wasumbinigi mane ok giriembogi kata matin.<verse eid="JOS 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 17:14"/>Joka Josef nowachone Joshua niya, “Ere gima omiyo isepogonwa kendo miyowa mana kamoro achiel kaka girkeni? Wasenyaa kendo Jehova Nyasaye osegwedhowa mogundho.”<verse eid="JOS 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 17:15"/>Joshua nodwokogi niya, “To ka usenyaa ahinya kamano kendo piny gode mag Efraim koro tinnu, kare koro dhiuru e bungu manie piny jo-Perizi kod jo-Refai mondo ubet kanyo obed maru.”<verse eid="JOS 17:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 17:16"/>Joka Josef to nodwoko niya, “Piny godeno ok oromowa, kendo jo-Kanaan duto modak e pawno nigi geche mag lweny ma tiendgi otimo nyinyo, kendo mago modak Beth Shan gi mier molwore kaachiel gi holo mar Jezreel bende nigi gechego.”<verse eid="JOS 17:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 17:17"/>To Joshua nowachone od Josef, ma gin Efraim kod Manase niya, “Usenyaa kendo un joma nigi teko. Ok unubed gi pok achiel kende, <verse eid="JOS 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 17:18"/>to nyaka piny moyugno manie got bende. Beteuru nyaka kuma unyalo, to obiro bedo maru; kata obedo ni jo-Kanaan nigi geche nyinyo kendo gi tegno, pod unyalo riembogi.”<verse eid="JOS 17:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JOS 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Pogo kuonde mane odongʼ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 18:1"/>Kanyakla duto mag jo-Israel nochokore Shilo ma giguro Hemb Romo kanyo. Pinyno nobedo e bwo lochgi, <verse eid="JOS 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 18:2"/>makmana ne pod nitiere dhout Israel abiriyo mane pod ok oyudo girkeni margi.<verse eid="JOS 18:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 18:3"/>Omiyo Joshua nowachone jo-Israel niya, “Ubiro rito nyaka karangʼo kapok uchako kawo mwandu mar piny mane Jehova Nyasaye, ma Nyasach wuoneu, asemiyou? <verse eid="JOS 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 18:4"/>Yieruru ji adek koa e dhoot ka dhoot. Abiro oorogi mondo gidhi ginon pinyno kendo gindik malongʼo kuom pinyno, kaluwore gi pok mar ngʼato ka ngʼato. Bangʼe, to gidwog ira. <verse eid="JOS 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 18:5"/>Nyaka upog pinyni e migepe abiriyo. Jo-Juda nyaka dongʼ kargi man yo milambo kendo joka Josef bende odongʼ kargi man yo nyandwat. <verse eid="JOS 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 18:6"/>Bangʼ ka usendiko malongʼo kuom migepe abiriyo mar pinyno, to ukelnagiuru kae kendo abiro pogonugi gi ombulu e nyim Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachwa. <verse eid="JOS 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 18:7"/>Kata kamano, jo-Lawi to ok noyud pok e dieru, nikech tichgi mar dolo ne Jehova Nyasaye e girkeni margi. To Gad, Reuben kod nus mar dhood Manase, to oseyudo girkeni margi e bath aora Jordan ma yo wuok chiengʼ nikech Musa jatich Jehova Nyasaye nosemiyogi.”<verse eid="JOS 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 18:8"/>E kinde mane jogi owuok mondo gidhi ginon piny, Joshua nomiyogi chik niya, “Dhiuru kendo utim nonro malongʼo mar pinyni kendo undik gik moko duto muyudo e iye. Bangʼe dwoguru ira kendo abiro miyou pok maru Shilo e nyim Jehova Nyasaye.” <verse eid="JOS 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 18:9"/>Omiyo jogo nowuok modhi koluwo dier piny tir. Negindiko gigo duto mane giyudo e pinyno e kitabu, e dala ka dala, e migepe abiriyo kendo mi gidwogo ir Joshua e kambi man Shilo.<verse eid="JOS 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 18:10"/>Bangʼe Joshua nomiyogo pok margi Shilo e nyim Jehova Nyasaye, kendo gikanyono nopogo jo-Israel pinyno kaluwore gi dhoutgi.<verse eid="JOS 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pok mar joka Benjamin</para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 18:11"/>Pok mar joka Benjamin, notimne anywola ka anywola. Kuonde mane opognigo ne ni e kind Juda gi Josef.<verse eid="JOS 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 18:12"/>Tongʼ-gi ma yo nyandwat nochakore e aora Jordan, kochomo pewe man yo nyandwat mar Jeriko, mi oluwo piny godego kochomo yo podho chiengʼ nyaka ochomo e thim mar Beth Aven. <verse eid="JOS 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 18:13"/>Koa kanyo nongʼado kodhi yo milambo mar pewe mag Luz (tiende ni, Bethel), modhi nyaka Ataroth Adar mantiere yo milambo mar Beth Horon Mamwalo.<verse eid="JOS 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 18:14"/>Koa e got momanyore gi Beth Horon mantiere yo milambo, tongʼno nogomo kochomo yo podho chiengʼ mar godno, mogik Kiriath Baal (tiende ni, Kiriath Jearim), ma en dala jo-Juda. Mano e tongʼ-gi ma yo podho chiengʼ.<verse eid="JOS 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 18:15"/>Tongʼ ma yo milambo nochakore oko mar Kiriath Jearim mantiere yo podho chiengʼ, kendo tongʼno nochopo nyaka thidhna mar pi Neftoa. <verse eid="JOS 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 18:16"/>Tongʼno nodhi nyaka e tiend got momanyore gi Holo mar Ben Hinom, kod yo nyandwat mar Holo mar Refaim. Nodhi nyime nyaka e Holo mar Hinom koluwo yo milambo mar pewe mar dala maduongʼ mar jo-Jebus kendo mochopo En Rogel. <verse eid="JOS 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 18:17"/>Bangʼe nogomo kochiko yo nyandwat, modhi nyaka En Shemesh, kendo nyaka Geliloth, momanyore gi Adumim, kendo oridore kadhi piny nyaka Kit Bohan ma wuod Reuben. <verse eid="JOS 18:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 18:18"/>Nodhi nyime nyaka yo nyandwat mar pewe mag Beth Araba mochopo nyaka Araba. <verse eid="JOS 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 18:19"/>Eka nodhi kendo yo nyandwat mar pewe mag Beth Hogla mi owuok koa yo nyandwat mar dho Nam Chumbi, kama aora Jordan ochakore godo mantiere yo milambo. Mano e tongʼ-gi ma yo milambo.<verse eid="JOS 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 18:20"/>Aora Jordan ne en tongʼ mantiere yo wuok chiengʼ.</para>
  <para style="li4" vid="JOS 18:20">Ma e kaka nopog ni anywola mar Benjamin pinygi.<verse eid="JOS 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 18:21"/>Mier madongo mane dhood Benjamin nitierego kaluwore gi anywolagi e magi:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 18:21">Jeriko, Beth Hogla, Emek Keziz, <verse eid="JOS 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 18:22"/>Beth Araba, Zemaraim, Bethel, <verse eid="JOS 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 18:23"/>Avim, Para, Ofra, <verse eid="JOS 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 18:24"/>Kefa Amoni, Ofni kod Geba. Giduto ne gin mier kod gwenge apar gariyo.<verse eid="JOS 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 18:25"/>Mier mamoko ne gin: Gibeon, Rama, Beeroth, <verse eid="JOS 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 18:26"/>Mizpa, Kefira, Moza, <verse eid="JOS 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 18:27"/>Rekem, Irpil, Tarala, <verse eid="JOS 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 18:28"/>Zela, Haelef, jo-Jebus (tiende ni, Jerusalem), Gibea kod Kiriath. Giduto ne gin mier kod gwenge maromo apar gangʼwen.</para>
  <para style="li4" vid="JOS 18:28">Magi e mier mane opog ni dhood Benjamin.<verse eid="JOS 18:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JOS 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Pok mar joka Simeon</para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 19:1"/>Pok mar ariyo nobiro ne dhood Simeon, kaluwore gi anywola margi. Girkeni margi ne nitiere e piny jo-Juda. <verse eid="JOS 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 19:2"/>Notingʼo:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 19:2">Bersheba (kata Sheba), Molada, <verse eid="JOS 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 19:3"/>Hazar Shual, Bala, Ezem, <verse eid="JOS 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 19:4"/>Eltolad, Bethul, Horma, <verse eid="JOS 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 19:5"/>Ziklag, Beth Makaboth, Hazar Shusa, <verse eid="JOS 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 19:6"/>Beth Lebaoth kod Sharuhen. Giduto ne gin mier kod gwenge maromo apar gadek.<verse eid="JOS 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 19:7"/>Mier mamoko ne gin: Ain, Rimon, Ether kod Ashan. Giduto ne gin mier kod gwenge maromo angʼwen, <verse eid="JOS 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 19:8"/>ka ok okwan mier matindo mokiewo kodgi mochopo nyaka Baalath Beer (ma bende iluongo ni Rama e piny Negev).</para>
  <para style="li4" vid="JOS 19:8">Magi e mier mane opog ne dhood Simeon kaluwore gi anywolagi. <verse eid="JOS 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 19:9"/>Girkeni mar dhood Simeon nopognegi koa kuom pok mar jo-Juda, nikech pok mar Juda ne duongʼ mohewogi. Omiyo dhood Simeon noyudo pok margi koa e piny Juda.<verse eid="JOS 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pok mar joka Zebulun</para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 19:10"/>Pok mar adek ne mar dhood Zebulun kaluwore anywolagi.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 19:10">Tongʼ mar pok margi nochopo nyaka Sarid. <verse eid="JOS 19:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 19:11"/>Koa yo podho chiengʼ nochiko Marala mochopo nyaka Dabesheth, kendo oyarore kochomo holo matut mantiere but Jokneam. <verse eid="JOS 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 19:12"/>Nogomo kochiko yo wuok chiengʼ koa Sarid nyaka e piny Kisloth Tabor kendo odhi nyime nyaka Daberath mi ogik Jafia. <verse eid="JOS 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 19:13"/>Bangʼe nodhi nyime gi yo wuok chiengʼ nyaka Gath Hefer kod Eth Kazin; bangʼe nowuok oko e Rimon mi ogomo yo Nea. <verse eid="JOS 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 19:14"/>Bangʼ Nea, tongʼno nochomo yo nyandwat mochopo nyaka Hanathon bangʼe to ogik e holo mar Ifta El.<verse eid="JOS 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 19:15"/>Pinyno notingʼo Katath, Nahalal, Shimron, Idala kod Bethlehem. Giduto ne gin mier kod gwenge apar gariyo.<verse eid="JOS 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 19:16"/>Magi e mier matindo kod gwenge mane opog ne dhood Zebulun kaluwore gi anywolagi.<verse eid="JOS 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pok mar joka Isakar</para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 19:17"/>Pok mar angʼwen nomi dhood Isakar kaluwore gi anywola margi. <verse eid="JOS 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 19:18"/>Pinyni notingʼo:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 19:18">Jezreel, Kesuloth, Shunem, <verse eid="JOS 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 19:19"/>Hafaraim, Shion, Anaharath, <verse eid="JOS 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 19:20"/>Rabith, Kishion, Ebez, <verse eid="JOS 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 19:21"/>Remeth, En Ganim, En Hada kod Beth Pazez.<verse eid="JOS 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 19:22"/>Tongʼ pinyno nochopo nyaka Tabor, Shahazuma gi Beth Shemesh, mi ogik nyaka aora Jordan.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 19:22">Giduto ne gin mier kod gwenge apar gauchiel.<verse eid="JOS 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 19:23"/>Magi e mier matindo kod gwenge mane opog ne dhood Isakar kaluwore gi anywolagi.<verse eid="JOS 19:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pok mar joka Asher</para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 19:24"/>Pok mar abich nomi dhoot Asher kaluwore gi anywolagi. <verse eid="JOS 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 19:25"/>Pinygi nopogi kama:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 19:25">Helkath, Hali, Beten, Akshaf, <verse eid="JOS 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 19:26"/>Alamelek, Amad kod Mishal. To yo podho chiengʼ, tongʼ-gi nochopo Karmel gi Shihor Libnath. <verse eid="JOS 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 19:27"/>Bangʼe tongʼno nochomo yo wuok chiengʼ mochopo nyaka Beth Dagon koluwo Zebulun gi Holo mar Ifta El, kochomo yo nyandwat nyaka Beth Emek gi Neyel kokalo e bath Kabul. <verse eid="JOS 19:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 19:28"/>Nodhi nyaka Abdon, Rehob, Hamon kod Kana, mochopo nyaka Sidon Maduongʼ. <verse eid="JOS 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 19:29"/>Bangʼe nodwok tongʼno chien nyaka Rama modhi nyaka e dala maduongʼ mar Turo mochiel gohinga, mogomo kochiko Hosa koluwo dho nam e gwengʼ mar Akzib, <verse eid="JOS 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 19:30"/>Uma, Afek kod Rehob.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 19:30">Giduto ne gin mier matindo kod gwenge piero ariyo gariyo.<verse eid="JOS 19:30"/></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 19:31"/>Magi e mier matindo kod gwenge mane opog ne dhood Asher kaluwore gi anywolagi.<verse eid="JOS 19:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pok mar joka Naftali</para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 19:32"/>Pok mar auchiel nomi dhood Naftali, kaluwore gi anywolagi.<verse eid="JOS 19:32"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 19:33"/>Tongʼ-gi nochakore Helef modhi nyaka kar yien maduongʼ man Zananim, koluwo Adami Nekeb gi Jabnel mochopo Lakum kendo gikone ne en aora Jordan. <verse eid="JOS 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 19:34"/>Tongʼno noluwo yo podho chiengʼ kokadho Aznoth Tabor kendo owuok Hukok. Gi yo milambo tongʼno nokiewo gi Zebulun, to yo podho chiengʼ nokiewo gi Asher; to yo wuok chiengʼ nokiewo gi aora Jordan.<verse eid="JOS 19:34"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 19:35"/>Mier mane ochiel gohinga ne gin: Zidin, Zer, Hamath, Rakath, Kinereth, <verse eid="JOS 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 19:36"/>Adama, Rama, Hazor, <verse eid="JOS 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 19:37"/>Kedesh, Edrei, En Hazor, <verse eid="JOS 19:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 19:38"/>Iron, Migdal El, Horem, Beth Anath kod Beth Shemesh.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 19:38">Giduto ne gin mier matindo kod gwenge apar gochiko.<verse eid="JOS 19:38"/></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 19:39"/>Magi e mier matindo kod gwenge mane opog ne dhood Naftali, kaluwore gi anywolagi.<verse eid="JOS 19:39"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pok mar joka Dan</para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 19:40"/>Pok mar abiriyo nomi dhood Dan, kaluwore gi anywola margi. <verse eid="JOS 19:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 19:41"/>Kuonde mane opog-gi ne gin:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 19:41">Zora, Eshtaol, Ir Shemesh, <verse eid="JOS 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 19:42"/>Shalabin, Aijalon, Ithla, <verse eid="JOS 19:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 19:43"/>Elon, Timna, Ekron, <verse eid="JOS 19:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JOS 19:44"/>Elteke, Gibethon, Baalath, <verse eid="JOS 19:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JOS 19:45"/>Jehud, Bene Berak, Gath Rimon, <verse eid="JOS 19:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JOS 19:46"/>Me Jarkon kod Rakon, to gi kama omanyore gi Jopa.<verse eid="JOS 19:46"/></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JOS 19:47"/>To dhood Dan ne nigi pek kuom kawo pok mar pinygi, omiyo negidhi ma gimonjo Leshem mi gikawe, bangʼe ginegogi gi ligangla. Negidak Leshem kendo ma gichake ni Dan mane en kwargi.<verse eid="JOS 19:47"/></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JOS 19:48"/>Magi e mier matindo kod gwenge mane opog ne dhood Dan, kaluwore gi anywolagi.<verse eid="JOS 19:48"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pok mar joka Joshua</para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JOS 19:49"/>Kane gisetieko pogo pinyno e migepe ka migepe, jo-Israel nomiyo Joshua wuod Nun pok e diergi, <verse eid="JOS 19:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JOS 19:50"/>mana kaka Jehova Nyasaye nosechiko. Negimiye dalano mane okwayogi, ma en, Timnath Sera manie piny Efraim. Kuom mano, nogero dala kanyo modakie.<verse eid="JOS 19:50"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JOS 19:51"/>Magi e pok mane Eliazar jadolo, Joshua wuod Nun kod jotelo mag dhout Israel nopogo lowo gombulu ka gin Shilo e nyim Jehova Nyasaye e dhoranga Hemb Romo. Omiyo negitieko pogo pinyno.<verse eid="JOS 19:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JOS 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Mier madongo mag tony</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 20:1"/>Eka Jehova Nyasaye nowachone Joshua niya, <verse eid="JOS 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 20:2"/>“Kone jo-Israel oyier miechgi madongo mag tony, kaka ne asenyisou kokalo kuom Musa, <verse eid="JOS 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 20:3"/>mondo ngʼato angʼata monego nyawadgi kobothne kendo ok dwarone nyalo biro kanyo mi oyud konyruok koa e lwet ngʼama dwaro chulone kuor.<verse eid="JOS 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 20:4"/>“Ka oringo mi obiro e achiel kuom mier madongogi, to nyaka ochungʼ e dhorangach mar dala maduongʼ mondo owach malongʼo chandruok mare e nyim jotend dala maduongʼno. Bangʼ mano to girwake ei dalagi maduongʼno kendo gimiye kama odakie kodgi. <verse eid="JOS 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 20:5"/>Ka ngʼat madwaro chulo kuor olawe, to kik gichiw ngʼatno modonjne, nikech ne onego nyawadgino ka ok ochano kendo ka oonge gi paro mar nege. <verse eid="JOS 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 20:6"/>Nyaka odag e dala maduongʼ kanyo machop chiengʼ bura e nyim kanyakla kendo nyaka chop chiengʼ ma jadolo maduongʼ marito kanyo tho. Bangʼeno onyalo dok e dalane owuon, ma en dalano mane oringo koaye.”<verse eid="JOS 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 20:7"/>Omiyo negiwalo tenge Kedesh man Galili e piny Naftali manie got, gi Shekem e piny Efraim manie got kod Kiriath Arba (tiende ni, Hebron), e piny Juda ma bende ni e got. <verse eid="JOS 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 20:8"/>To yo wuok chiengʼ mar Aora Jordan (e piny mamalo momanyore gi Jeriko) negiyiero Bezer manie thim kuom piny dhood Reuben gi Ramoth mantiere Gilead kuom piny dhood Gad, kod Golan mantiere Bashan e dhood Manase. <verse eid="JOS 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 20:9"/>Ja-Israel moro amora kata jadak mora amora modak e diergi ma nonego ngʼato ka ok ochano kendo ka oonge gi paro mar nege mondo odhi e mier madongo mowal mar tony mondo kik neg-gi gi ngʼatno madwaro chulo kuor kapok otergi e bura e nyim kanyakla.<verse eid="JOS 20:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JOS 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Mier matindo mag jo-Lawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 21:1"/>Bangʼe jotelo mag anywola mag dhout jo-Lawi nobiro ir Eliazar jadolo, Joshua wuod Nun, kod jotelo mag dhout anywola mamoko mag Israel, <verse eid="JOS 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 21:2"/>kama iluongo ni Shilo ei Kanaan mi giwachonegi niya, “Jehova Nyasaye nochiko kokalo kuom Musa ni mondo imiwa dalano mondo wadagie, kod kuonde ma jambwa nyalo kwayoe.”<verse eid="JOS 21:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 21:3"/>Omiyo kaka Jehova Nyasaye nosechiko, jo-Israel nomiyo jo-Lawi mier matindogi kod kuonde kwath koa kuom pokgi giwegi.<verse eid="JOS 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 21:4"/>Pok mokwongo nodhine jo-Kohath kaluwore gi anywola margi. Jo-Lawi mane nyikwa Harun jadolo nopog mier matindo apar gadek koa e dhout Juda, Simeon kod Benjamin.<verse eid="JOS 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 21:5"/>Nyikwa Kohath mane odongʼ nopog mier matindo apar koa e anywola mar dhout Efraim, Dan kod nus mar dhood Manase.<verse eid="JOS 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 21:6"/>Nyikwa Gershon nopog mier matindo apar gadek koa e anywola mar dhood Isakar, Asher, Naftali, to gi nus mar dhood Manase man Bashan.<verse eid="JOS 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 21:7"/>Nyikwa Merari kaluwore gi anywola margi, noyudo mier matindo apar gariyo koa e dhood Reuben, Gad kod Zebulun.<verse eid="JOS 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 21:8"/>Omiyo jo-Israel nopogo jo-Lawi mier matindogi kod kuonde kwath, mana kaka Jehova Nyasaye nochiko kokalo kuom Musa.<verse eid="JOS 21:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 21:9"/>Koa e dhout Juda kod Simeon negipogo mier matindogi gi nying-gi kama: <verse eid="JOS 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 21:10"/>mier matindogi ne gin mek nyikwa Harun mane oa kuom jo-Kohath e anywola mar jo-Lawi, nikech pok mokwongo nomigi.<verse eid="JOS 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 21:11"/>Ne gimiyogi Kiriath Arba (tiende ni, Hebron), gi kuonde kwath, mantiere e piny manie got mar Juda. Arba ne en kwar jo-Anak. <verse eid="JOS 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 21:12"/>To puothe kod gwenge molworo dala maduongʼ ne gisemiyo Kaleb wuod Jefune kaka pok mare. <verse eid="JOS 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 21:13"/>Omiyo nyikwa Harun jadolo negimiyo Hebron (ma en dala maduongʼ mar tony mar ngʼama oneko), Libna, <verse eid="JOS 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 21:14"/>Jatir, Eshtemoa, <verse eid="JOS 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 21:15"/>Holon, Debir, <verse eid="JOS 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 21:16"/>Ain, Juta kod Beth Shemesh, kaachiel gi legegi mag kwath. Giduto ne gin mier matindo ochiko koa e dhoudi ariyogi.<verse eid="JOS 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 21:17"/>To koa e dhood Benjamin ne gimiyogi</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JOS 21:17">Gibeon, Geba, <verse eid="JOS 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 21:18"/>Anathoth kod Almon, kaachiel gi kuondegi mag kwath. Giduto ne gin mier matindo angʼwen.<verse eid="JOS 21:18"/></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 21:19"/>Mier matindo duto mane omi jodolo ma nyikwa Harun, ne gin apar gadek, kaachiel gi legegi mag kwath.<verse eid="JOS 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 21:20"/>Anywola mar jo-Kohath mar dhood Lawi mane odongʼ nopog mier matindo koa e dhood Efraim.<verse eid="JOS 21:20"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 21:21"/>E yo kama otingʼore mar Efraim nomi</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JOS 21:21">Shekem (ma en dala maduongʼ mar tony ne ngʼatno miparo kuome ni oneko) kod Gezer, <verse eid="JOS 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 21:22"/>Kibzaim kod Beth Horon, kaachiel gi legegi mag kwath. Giduto ne gin mier matindo angʼwen.<verse eid="JOS 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 21:23"/>Bende koa e dhood Dan nomigi</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JOS 21:23">Elteke, Gibethon, <verse eid="JOS 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 21:24"/>gi Aijalon kod Gath Rimon, kaachiel gi legegi mag kwath. Giduto ne gin mier matindo angʼwen.<verse eid="JOS 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 21:25"/>Koa e nus mar dhood Manase nomigi</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JOS 21:25">Tanak kod Gath Rimon, kaachiel gi legegi mag kwath. Giduto ne gin mier matindo ariyo.<verse eid="JOS 21:25"/></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 21:26"/>Mier matindogi apar kod legegi mag kwath nomi anywola jo-Kohath mane odongʼ.<verse eid="JOS 21:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 21:27"/>Mier mane omi jo-Gershon maa e dhood Lawi ne gin:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 21:27">Koa e nus mar dhood Manase, nomigi,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JOS 21:27">Golan mantiere Bashan (ma en dala maduongʼ mar pondo ne ngʼatno miparo kuome ni oneko), kod Be Eshtara, kaachiel gi legegi mag kwath. Giduto ne gin mier matindo ariyo.<verse eid="JOS 21:27"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 21:28"/>Koa e dhood Isakar, nomigi,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JOS 21:28">Kishion, Daberath, <verse eid="JOS 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 21:29"/>Jarmuth kod En Ganim, kaachiel gi legegi mag kwath. Giduto ne gin mier matindo angʼwen.<verse eid="JOS 21:29"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 21:30"/>Koa e dhood Asher nomigi,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JOS 21:30">Mishal, Abdon, <verse eid="JOS 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 21:31"/>Helkath kod Rehob, kaachiel gi legegi mag kwath. Giduto ne gin mier matindo angʼwen.<verse eid="JOS 21:31"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 21:32"/>Koa e dhood Naftali, nomigi,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JOS 21:32">Kedesh man Galili (ma en dala maduongʼ mar pondo ne ngʼatno miparo kuome ni oneko), gi Hamoth Dor kod Kartan, kaachiel gi legegi mag kwath. Giduto ne gin mier matindo adek.<verse eid="JOS 21:32"/></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 21:33"/>Mier matindo duto mar anywola jo-Gershon ne gin apar gadek, kaachiel gi legegi mag kwath.<verse eid="JOS 21:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 21:34"/>Anywola jo-Merari (ma gin jo-Lawi mamoko) nomi:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 21:34">Koa e dhood Zebulun nomi:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JOS 21:34">Jokneam, Karta, <verse eid="JOS 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 21:35"/>Dimna kod Nahalal, kaachiel gi legegi mag kwath. Giduto ne gin mier matindo angʼwen.<verse eid="JOS 21:35"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 21:36"/>Koa e dhood Reuben nomi:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JOS 21:36">Bezer, Jahaz, <verse eid="JOS 21:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 21:37"/>Kedemoth kod Mefath, kaachiel gi legegi mag kwath. Giduto ne gin mier matindo angʼwen.<verse eid="JOS 21:37"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 21:38"/>Koa e dhood Gad nomi:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JOS 21:38">Ramoth mantiere Gilead (ma en dala maduongʼ mar pondo ne ngʼatno miparo kuome ni oneko), gi Mahanaim, <verse eid="JOS 21:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 21:39"/>Heshbon kod Jazer, kaachiel gi legegi mag kwath. Giduto ne gin mier matindo angʼwen.<verse eid="JOS 21:39"/></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 21:40"/>Mier matindo duto mane opog ni anywola jo-Merari mane gin jo-Lawi modongʼ, ne gin apar gariyo.<verse eid="JOS 21:40"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 21:41"/>Mier matindo mag jo-Lawi e piny mane jo-Israel okawo ne gin piero angʼwen gaboro giduto, kaachiel gi legegi mag kwath. <verse eid="JOS 21:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 21:42"/>Mier matindogi moro ka moro ne nigi legegi mag kwath e alworagi, kendo ma ne en adiera ne mier matindogi duto.<verse eid="JOS 21:42"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 21:43"/>Omiyo Jehova Nyasaye nomiyo jo-Israel pinje duto mane osingore ni enomi kweregi, kendo ne gikawogi mi gidakie. <verse eid="JOS 21:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JOS 21:44"/>Jehova Nyasaye nomiyogi kwe, mana kaka ne osesingore ni enomi kweregi. Onge wasikgi moro amora mane omonjogi; kendo Jehova Nyasaye nochiwo wasikgi duto e lwetgi. <verse eid="JOS 21:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JOS 21:45"/>Onge singruok moro amora mane Jehova Nyasaye omiyo jo-Israel mane ok otimonegi; moro ka moro nochopo kaka nowacho.<verse eid="JOS 21:45"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JOS 22"/>
  <para style="s1">Dhoudi ma yo wuok chiengʼ odwogo dala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 22:1"/>Eka Joshua noluongo jo-Reuben, jo-Gad kod nus mar dhood Manase <verse eid="JOS 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 22:2"/>mowachonegi niya, “Usetimo gigo duto mane Musa jatich Jehova Nyasaye ochiko, kendo bende useluora e gigo duto mane achikou. <verse eid="JOS 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 22:3"/>Kuom kinde mangʼeny nyaka kawuononi, pok ujwangʼo oweteu, to usetimo tich mane Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu omiyou. <verse eid="JOS 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 22:4"/>Ka koro Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu osemiyo oweteu kwe kaka ne osesingo, doguru e miechu e piny mane Musa jatich Jehova Nyasaye nomiyou e bath aora Jordan kocha. <verse eid="JOS 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 22:5"/>To beduru motangʼ kurito puonj kod chike mane Musa jatich Jehova Nyasaye omiyou kama: heruru Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu, wuothuru e yorene duto, luoruru chikene, padreuru kuome kendo tineuru gi ngimau duto.”<verse eid="JOS 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 22:6"/>Bangʼe Joshua nogwedhogi mi oorogi, kendo negidok e miechgi. <verse eid="JOS 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 22:7"/>To ne nus mar dhood Manase, Musa nomiyogi piny mantiere Bashan, to nus machielo mar dhoodno, Joshua nomiyogi piny mantiere yo podho chiengʼ mar aora Jordan kaachiel gi owetene. Kane Joshua osegologi mondo gidog e miechgi, nogwedhogi kowacho niya, <verse eid="JOS 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 22:8"/>“Ero udok e miechu gi mwandu mangʼeny kaka kweth mar jamni mathoth, fedha, dhahabu, mula gi nyinyo, kod lewni mangʼeny kendo neuru ni upogone oweteu gigo mane upeyo kuom wasiku.”<verse eid="JOS 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 22:9"/>Omiyo jo-Reuben, jo-Gad kod nus mar dhood Manase noweyo jo-Israel Shilo mantiere Kanaan, mondo gidogi Gilead, pinygi giwegi, mane giyudo kaluwore gi chik Jehova Nyasaye kokalo kuom Musa.<verse eid="JOS 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 22:10"/>Kane gibiro Geliloth but aora Jordan e piny Kanaan, jo-Reuben, jo-Gad kod nus mar dhood Manase nogero kendo mar misango machiegni gi aora Jordan. <verse eid="JOS 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 22:11"/>To ka jo-Israel nowinjo ni negisegero kendo mar misango e tongʼ Kanaan kama iluongo ni Geliloth but aora Jordan yo kor jo-Israel, <verse eid="JOS 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 22:12"/>oganda duto mar Israel nochokore Shilo mondo gidhi giked kodgi.<verse eid="JOS 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 22:13"/>Omiyo jo-Israel nooro Finehas wuod Eliazar jadolo, e piny Gilead, ir jo-Reuben, jo-Gad kod nus mar dhood Manase, <verse eid="JOS 22:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 22:14"/>mi nodhi gi jotelo apar mag dhout Israel kamoro ka moro ochungʼ ne dhoot ka dhoot.<verse eid="JOS 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 22:15"/>Kane gidhi Gilead, ir dhood Reuben, Gad kod nus mar dhood Manase, negiwachonegi niya, <verse eid="JOS 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 22:16"/>“Oganda duto mar Jehova Nyasaye wacho kama: Ere gima omiyo uketho winjruok maru gi Nyasach Israel? Ere gima omiyo ungʼanyo ni Jehova Nyasaye mi ugero kendo mar misango ni un uwegi e yor wangʼ teko? <verse eid="JOS 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 22:17"/>Donge richo mane watimo Peor oromo? Nyaka chil kawuono kum mane Jehova Nyasaye omiyowa pok orumo! <verse eid="JOS 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 22:18"/>Uparo ni kumno ne yot ma pod udhi nyime mana ne ngʼanyo ni Jehova Nyasaye?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 22:18">“ ‘Ka dipo ni pod ukwedo Jehova Nyasaye kawuono, to kiny iye biro wangʼ gi jo-Israel duto. <verse eid="JOS 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 22:19"/>Ka piny ma ukawoni odwanyore, to biuru e piny Jehova Nyasaye, kama ogurie hekalu mar Jehova Nyasaye, kendo mondo udag kodwa e pinyni. To kik ukwed Jehova Nyasaye kata mana wan bende ka ugero kendo mar misango ne un uwegi, makmana kendo mar misango mar Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachwa kende. <verse eid="JOS 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 22:20"/>Donge uparo kaka Akan wuod Zera notimo richo e nyim Jehova Nyasaye, momiyo oganda jo-Israel duto okum? Ok en kende ema notho nikech richone.’ ”<verse eid="JOS 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 22:21"/>Jo-Reuben, Gad kod nus mar dhood Manase nodwoko jotend anywola mag jo-Israel niya, <verse eid="JOS 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 22:22"/>“Jehova Nyasaye en Nyasaye Maratego! Jehova Nyasaye en Nyasaye Maratego! Ongʼeyo gik moko duto! Israel mondo ongʼe! Ka dipo ni ma notim e yor ngʼanyo, kata bedo maonge gi luor ne Jehova Nyasaye, to kik ingʼwon-nwa kawuono. <verse eid="JOS 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 22:23"/>Ka dipo ni wagero kendowa mar misango owuon mondo waa ir Jehova Nyasaye kendo mondo wachiw misango miwangʼo pep kod chiwo mar cham, kata ni wachiw misango mar lalruok kuome, to mad Jehova Nyasaye kumwa kaka joma osetimo richo.<verse eid="JOS 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 22:24"/>“Ooyo! Ne watimo kamano nikech chiengʼ moro nyikwawa nyalo wachone nyikwau ni, ‘En angʼo ma wanyalo timo gi Jehova Nyasaye, ma Nyasach Israel? <verse eid="JOS 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 22:25"/>Jehova Nyasaye oseketo aora Jordan mondo opog kindwa kodu, un joka Reuben kod joka Gad! Uonge kod pok moro kuom Jehova Nyasaye.’ Omiyo nyikwau nyalo miyo nyikwawa weyo luoro Jehova Nyasaye.<verse eid="JOS 22:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 22:26"/>“Mano emomiyo nwawacho ni, ‘Waikreuru kendo wager kendo mar misango, to ok mar misango miwangʼo pep, kata ni sewni mamoko.’ <verse eid="JOS 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 22:27"/>To kata kamano, ma onego obed ranyisi e kindwa kodu to gi tiengʼ mabiro bangʼwa, ni wabiro lamo Jehova Nyasaye e kare maler mar lemo ka wachiwone misango miwangʼo pep, misengini mamoko kod misango mar lalruok. Bangʼe ndalo mabiro nyikwau ok nowach ne nyikwawa ni, ‘Uonge gi pok kuom Jehova Nyasaye.’<verse eid="JOS 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 22:28"/>“To ne wawacho niya, ‘Ka dipo ni giwachonwa ma, kata ne nyikwawa to wabiro dwoko kama: Neuru kendo mar misango mar Jehova Nyasaye, mane kwerewa ogero, mondo obed kaka ranyisi e kindwa kodu, to ok ni chiwo misango miwangʼo pep.’<verse eid="JOS 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 22:29"/>“Mad wabed mabor gi ngʼanyone Jehova Nyasaye, mi walokre waa kuome kawuono ka wagero kendo mar misango miwangʼo pep, chiwo mar cham kod misengini mamoko moloyo kendo mar misango mar Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachwa mochungʼ e nyim kare maler.”<verse eid="JOS 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 22:30"/>Kane Finehas jadolo kod jotend gwengʼ, ma gin jotend anywola mar jo-Israel, nowinjo gima Reuben, Gad kod Manase nowacho, negibedo gi mor. <verse eid="JOS 22:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 22:31"/>Kendo Finehas wuod Eliazar ma jadolo, nowachone Reuben, Gad kod Manase niya, “Kawuono wangʼeyo ni Jehova Nyasaye nikodwa, nikech ok usetimo gima Jehova Nyasaye okwero. Kuom mano usereso jo-Israel kuom kum mar Jehova Nyasaye.”<verse eid="JOS 22:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 22:32"/>Bangʼe Finehas wuod Eliazar ma jadolo, kod jotelo noduogo Kanaan koa e romogi gi jo-Reuben kod jo-Gad mane nitiere Gilead kendo ne gidwokone jo-Israel wach. <verse eid="JOS 22:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 22:33"/>Negimor kuom winjo wachni kendo negipako Nyasaye. Ne ok gichako giwuoyo kendo kuom dhi kedo kodgi mondo giketh piny ma dhood Reuben kod Gad odakie.<verse eid="JOS 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 22:34"/>Dhood Reuben kod Gad nomiyo kendo mar misangono nying machalo kama: Ranyisi e Kindwa ni Jehova Nyasaye en Nyasaye.<verse eid="JOS 22:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JOS 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Joshua ogoyo oriti ne jotelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 23:1"/>Bangʼ kinde moko ka Jehova Nyasaye nosemiyo jo-Israel kwe e kindgi gi wasikgi duto, noyudo ka koro Joshua oseti kendo ne en gi higni moniangʼ, <verse eid="JOS 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 23:2"/>omiyo noluongo jo-Israel duto kaachiel gi jodong-gi, jotelo, jongʼad bura kod jotelo mamoko kendo mi owachonegi niya, “Aseti kendo hika oseniangʼ. <verse eid="JOS 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 23:3"/>Un uwegi useneno gigo ma Jehova Nyasaye osetimo ni ogendinigi duto nikech un; ne en Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu ema nokedonu. <verse eid="JOS 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 23:4"/>Paruru kaka asepogo ni dhoutu pinje duto mag ogendini mane odongʼ kaka girkeni, ogendini mane aloyo, modak e kind aora Jordan kod Nam Maduongʼ mantiere yo podho chiengʼ. <verse eid="JOS 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 23:5"/>Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu owuon biro riembo wasiku e nyimu. Omiyo riembgiuru gia e nyimu, kendo unukaw pinygi, mana kaka Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu nosingonu.<verse eid="JOS 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 23:6"/>“Beduru motegno ahinya; beduru motangʼ mondo ulu mago duto mondikie Kitabu mar Chik mar Musa, ma ok udok yo korachwich kata koracham. <verse eid="JOS 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 23:7"/>Kik uriwru gi ogendini modongʼ e dieru, kik uluong nying nyisechegi kata kik ukwongʼru gi nying-gi. Kik utinegi kata kik ukulrunegi. <verse eid="JOS 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 23:8"/>To nyaka umak Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu motegno, mana kaka usebedo ka utimo.”<verse eid="JOS 23:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 23:9"/>“Jehova Nyasaye oseriembo e nyimu oganda maduongʼ kendo maratego; kendo nyaka odiechiengni onge ngʼama oseloyou. <verse eid="JOS 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 23:10"/>Ngʼato achiel biro lawo ji alufu achiel, nikech Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu kedonu, mana kaka ne osingonu. <verse eid="JOS 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 23:11"/>Omiyo beduru motangʼ mondo uher Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu.<verse eid="JOS 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 23:12"/>“To ka ungʼanyo mi uriworu kod jogo motony manie pinyni modongʼ e dieru kendo unywomoru kodgi, <verse eid="JOS 23:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 23:13"/>to ngʼeuru ni Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu ok nochak oriemb ogendini e dieru kendo. Jogo nobednu obadho gi ramaki, boka mi chwadogo ngʼeu, kendo kudho e wengeu, nyaka chop ulal nono uae pinyni, ma Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu osemiyou.<verse eid="JOS 23:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 23:14"/>“Koro sani adwaro dhi kuma ji duto manie piny dhiyoe. Ungʼeyo malongʼo gi chunyu duto ni onge singo moro amora ma Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu nomiyou ma pod ok otimo. Singo duto osetimo maonge modongʼ. <verse eid="JOS 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 23:15"/>Mana kaka singo duto maber mar Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu osebedo adiera, omiyo Jehova Nyasaye biro kelo kuomu gigo maricho duto mobwogou godo, nyaka one ni otiekou pep e piny maberni ma osemiyou. <verse eid="JOS 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 23:16"/>Ka uketho singruok mane kindu gi Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu, mane ochikou, kendo mi udhi ma utiyo ne nyiseche manono kukulorunegi, to mirimb Nyasaye biro olore kuomu, kendo ubiro lal nono piyo e piny maber ma osemiyouni.”<verse eid="JOS 23:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JOS 24"/>
  <para style="s1">Singruok manyien e dala Shekem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 24:1"/>Bangʼe Joshua nochoko dhout Israel duto kama iluongo ni Shekem. Noluongo jodongo, jotelo, jongʼad bura kod jotelo mamoko mag Israel mi gidhi e nyim Nyasaye.<verse eid="JOS 24:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 24:2"/>Joshua nowachone ji duto niya, “Ma e gima Jehova Nyasaye, ma Nyasach Israel wacho, Chon gi lala kwereu, motingʼo nyaka Tera ma wuon Ibrahim kod Nahor, nodak but Aora Yufrate kendo negilamo nyiseche manono. <verse eid="JOS 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 24:3"/>Makmana nagolo wuonu Ibrahim oa e pinyno machiegni gi Aora Yufrate mi atelone e piny Kanaan duto kendo amiye nyikwayo mathoth. Ne amiye Isaka, <verse eid="JOS 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 24:4"/>to Isaka namiyo Jakobo kod Esau. Ne awalo piny Seir manie got ne Esau, to Jakobo gi nyithinde nodhi Misri.<verse eid="JOS 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 24:5"/>“ ‘Bangʼe ne aoro Musa gi Harun, kendo ne agoyo jo-Misri gi tuoche kanyo, bangʼe agolou oko. <verse eid="JOS 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 24:6"/>Kane agolo wuoneu Misri, ne uchopo e nam, kendo jo-Misri nolawou gi geche kod jogo mariambo farese nyaka e Nam Makwar. <verse eid="JOS 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 24:7"/>To ne giywakne Jehova Nyasaye mondo okonygi, omiyo ne oketo mudho e kindu gi jo-Misri; mi nam oimogi. Ne uneno gima ne atimone jo-Misri. Bangʼ mano nudak e thim kuom ndalo marabora.<verse eid="JOS 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 24:8"/>“ ‘Ne akelou nyaka e piny jo-Amor manodak yo wuok chiengʼ mar aora Jordan. Negikedo kodu, to naketogi e lwetu. Ne atiekogi chuth e nyimu, mi ukawo pinygi. <verse eid="JOS 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 24:9"/>Kane Balak wuod Zipor, ma ruodh Moab, ne ikore mondo oked gi Israel, nooro Balaam wuod Beor mondo okwongʼu. <verse eid="JOS 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 24:10"/>To ne ok anyal chiko ita ne Balaam, omiyo nogwedhou mogundho, mi nagolou oko e lwete.<verse eid="JOS 24:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 24:11"/>“ ‘Bangʼe ne ungʼado aora Jordan mi ubiro Jeriko. Joma odak Jeriko, kaka jo-Amor, jo-Perizi, jo-Kanaan, jo-Hiti, jo-Girgash, jo-Hivi, gi jo-Jebus nokedo kodu, to ne achiwogi duto e lwetu. <verse eid="JOS 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 24:12"/>Ne amiyo kibaji omakogi ma giringo e nyimu, kaachiel gi ruodhi jo-Amor ariyo. Ne ok utimo ma gi liganglau uwegi kod atungʼ. <verse eid="JOS 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 24:13"/>Omiyo ne amiyou piny mane ok utiyone kod mier madongo mane ok ugero; mi udak kanyo kendo uchamo olemb mzabibu kod zeituni ma bende ne ok upidho.’<verse eid="JOS 24:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 24:14"/>“Omiyo koro luoruru Jehova Nyasaye kendo beduru joratiro kinde duto kutiyone. Wituru oko nyiseche manono mag kwereu mane gilamo yo Aora Yufrate kod e piny Misri, mondo uti ne Jehova Nyasaye. <verse eid="JOS 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 24:15"/>To ka dipo ni tiyone Jehova Nyasaye ok miu mor, to kawuononi yier aneuru ngʼama ubiro tiyone, kata ka en nyiseche manono mane kwereu tiyone e Aora Yufrate, kata en nyiseche manono mag jo-Amor, modak e pinygi. Makmana an gi jooda duto, wabiro tiyone Jehova Nyasaye.”<verse eid="JOS 24:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 24:16"/>Eka ji nodwoko niya, “Mad gima chal kamano kik timrenwa ka wajwangʼo Jehova Nyasaye, mondo watine nyiseche manono! <verse eid="JOS 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 24:17"/>En Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachwa owuon mane ogolowa gi kwerewa e piny Misri, e piny mane wan wasumbini, kendo motimo ranyisi madongo-go ka waneno. Ne oritowa e wuodhwa duto kendo e kind ogendini duto mane wakalo eigi. <verse eid="JOS 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 24:18"/>Kendo Jehova Nyasaye ne oriembo ogendini duto e nyimwa, kaachiel gi jo-Amor, mane odak e pinyno. Wan bende wabiro tiyone Jehova Nyasaye, nikech en e Nyasachwa.”<verse eid="JOS 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 24:19"/>Joshua nowachone ji niya, “Ok unyal tiyone Jehova Nyasaye. En Nyasaye maler, en Nyasaye ma janyiego. Ok obi wenu kuom wich teko maru kod richo mutimo. <verse eid="JOS 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 24:20"/>Ka ungʼanyo uweyo Jehova Nyasaye mi utiyo ne nyiseche manono, to obiro lokore mi okelnu thagruok kendo enotieku duto, kata obedo ni ne osedoko jakoru kamano.”<verse eid="JOS 24:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 24:21"/>To jo-Israel nodwoko Joshua niya, “Ooyo! Wabiro tiyone Jehova Nyasaye.”<verse eid="JOS 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 24:22"/>Bangʼe Joshua nowacho niya, “Un uwegi usebedo joneno magu kuom yiero mondo uti ne Jehova Nyasaye.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 24:22">Negidwoko niya, “Ee, wan joneno.”<verse eid="JOS 24:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 24:23"/>Joshua nowacho niya, “Koro wituru nyiseche manono manie dieru mondo uchiw chunyu ni tiyo ne Jehova Nyasaye, ma Nyasach Israel.”<verse eid="JOS 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 24:24"/>To jogo nowachone Joshua niya, “Wabiro tiyone Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachwa kendo wanamiye luor.”<verse eid="JOS 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 24:25"/>E odiechiengno Joshua noketo singruok ne jogo, kendo kane gin Shekem nomiyogi chike monego gilu. <verse eid="JOS 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 24:26"/>Joshua nondiko gigo duto piny e Kitabu mar Chik mar Nyasaye. Bangʼe nokawo kidi maduongʼ mi okete maber e tiend yiend ober but kama ler mar Jehova Nyasaye.<verse eid="JOS 24:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 24:27"/>Nowachone jogo niya, “Neuru! Kidini biro bedo janeno kuomu. Osewinjo weche duto ma Jehova Nyasaye osewachonwa. Obiro bedo janeno kuomu ka ubedo jo-miriambo ne Nyasachu.”<verse eid="JOS 24:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tho mar Joshua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 24:28"/>Bangʼe Joshua nogolo ji duto mondo odhi kuondegi mane opognigi.<verse eid="JOS 24:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 24:29"/>Bangʼ mago duto, Joshua wuod Nun, jatich Jehova Nyasaye, notho ka en gi higni mia achiel gapar. <verse eid="JOS 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 24:30"/>Kendo ne giike e lope mane opogne, mantiere Timnath Sera e piny gode mag Efraim, mantiere yo nyandwat mar Gash.<verse eid="JOS 24:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 24:31"/>Jo-Israel notiyone Jehova Nyasaye e ndalo duto mag ngima Joshua kod jodongo mane osedak higni moloye, kendo mane nigi lony kuom gik moko duto mane Jehova Nyasaye osetimo ni jo-Israel.<verse eid="JOS 24:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 24:32"/>To choke Josef, mane jo-Israel nobiro godo koa Misri, noiki Shekem e pinyno mane Jakobo ongʼiewo fedha mia achiel koa kuom yawuot Hamor, ma wuon Shekem. Ma nobedo kaka pok mar nyikwa Josef.<verse eid="JOS 24:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 24:33"/>Eliazar wuod Harun bende notho kendo noyike Gibea, kama nopogne wuode Finehas e piny gode mag Efraim.<verse eid="JOS 24:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 24"/>
</usx>
